<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">2 Kumpite</book>
  <para style="h">2 Kumpite</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Kumpite</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kumpite</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Kumpite</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahab a si zaw ciengin Moab in Israel ledo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Samaria-a a innkhan tungnung vathang panin Ahaziah kiesuhin a liem hi; tuaci’n ama in kamtaite sawlin amate kungah, “Va pei ta unlen tam ka liemna pan ka dam zo na diei, Ekron pasien Baal-zebub va dong ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanle Topa’ vantungmi in Tishbe khuomi Elijah kungah, “Ding inlen, Samaria kumpipa’ kamtaite kimupi-in amate kungah, ‘Israel sungah Pasien a op nawn lo ziehin Ekron pasien Baal-zebub kunga thu dong dinga kisa na hi uh amah?’ ci in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Na katona na lupna na kan nawn sih ding a, nang a si valon ding na hi hi,’ ci-in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Elijah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa kungah kamtaite a kilekia vua, kumpipa in amate kungah, “Bang dinga hing kilekia na hi vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in dawngin, “Kote tawh kimu dingin mi khat ang pei a, ama in ka kung vuah, ‘No ang sawl kumpipa kungah peikia unlen ama kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Israel sungah Pasien om nawn lo ahi ziehin Ekron pasien Baal-zebub thu dong dinga mi na sawl amah? Tua ahi ziehin, ‘Na lupna na kan nawn sih ding a, nang na si valon ding hi,’ ei ci hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “No ang kimupipa le tami thu teng ang gen pa bangci bang mi ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in dawngin, “Ama pen mul hau khat ahi a, a kawngah savun kawnggah a gah hi,” a ci uhi. Tuale ama in, “Ama pen Tishbe mi Elijah ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in ama kungah mihing sawmnga a uhpa a mihing sawmnga tawh a sawl hi. Muol dawn khat a na to Elijah kungah ama kato-in a kungah, “Pasien’ mipa aw, kumpipa in, ‘Hing peisuh heh,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hizongle Elijah in mihing sawmnga a uhpa dawng a, “Pasien’ mipa ka hi leh van panin meikuong ang kiesuh hinlen, nangma le na mihing sawmngate katum taheh,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin van panin meikuong kiesuhin ama le a mihing sawmnga a katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama kungah mihing sawmnga a uh adang khat a mihing sawmnga ma tawh a sawlkia hi. Ama kato-in tua mipa kungah, “Pasien’ mipa aw, tam khu kumpipa thupieh ahi hi: Mallang tahin hing kumsuh in!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Elijah in amate dawng a, “Pasien’ mipa ka hi leh van panin meikuong ang kiesuh hinlen, nangma le na mihing sawmngate katum heh,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin van panin meikuong kiesuhin ama le a mihing sawmngate a katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa in mihing sawmnga a uh a thumna pa mihing sawmnga tawh sawlkia leuleu hi. Tuaci’n mihing sawmnga a uh a thumna pa peito a, Elijah mai-ah pei-in khupdinin pua a, ama kungah tau-in, “Pasien’ mipa aw, hing thum ing, na muna-ah keima’ hinna le nangma’ nasem tam mihing sawmngate’ hinna manphasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />En in, vantung panin meikuong kiesuhin mihing sawmngate a uh a masa nite a mi sawmnga tuoh utawh a katum uhi; ahi vangin tu-in na muna-ah ka hinna manphasah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ vantungmi in Elijah kungah, “Ama tawh zawhsuh in; ama giing malmal sin,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama dingin kumpipa kungah ama tawh peisuh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ama kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Nangma in Ekron pasien Baal-zebub thu dong dingin kamtaite sawl tahtah na hi ziehin, Israel sungah thu dawh ding Pasien a om nawn sih amah? Tua ahi ziehin nangma in na katona na lupna na nuasie sih ding a, na si valon ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n Elijah in a gensa Topa’ thu tawh kizui-in ama a si hi. Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat’ tapa Jehoram uh a kum nina kumin a sanggampa Joram in ama’ za luo hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Ahaziah in tapa nei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in Ahaziah’ gamtatna a sepsa a omlai teng, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in vantungah pumpei tawh Elijah a lahto kuonin Elijah le Elisha-te Gilgal panin inn lam zuonin lamkalah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elijah in Elisha kungah, “Tanah na om in; bangzieh ahei cile Topa in Bethel cieng dong pha dingin kei ei sawl hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin Elisha in, “ Topa hingin nangma zong a hing na hi ma bangin, nang kang nuasie sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Bethel ah ama gel a peisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elisha kungah Bethel-a om kamsang honkhat a pei vua, amate in, “Tuni-in nangma kung panin Topa in na pupa a lah ding lam na thei ei mah?” a ci uhi. Tuale ama in, “Hi hi, ka thei hi; dai dide un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Elijah in ama kungah, “Elisha, tanah na om in; azieh pen Topa in Jericho cieng dong pha dingin ei sawl hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ama in, “ Topa hingin nangma zong na hin ma bangin nang kang nuasie sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama gel Jericho-ah a zawhton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jericho-a om kamsang honkhat in Elisha nai-in ama kungah, “Tuni-in Topa in nang kung pan na pupa a lah ding lam na thei ei mah?” a ci uhi. Ama in dawng a, “Hi hi, ka thei hi; dai dide un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Elijah in ama kungah, “Tanah na om in; Topa in Jordan cieng dong pha dingin ei sawl hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ama in, “ Topa hing a, nangma zong a hing na hi ma bangin nang kang nuasie sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama gel a zawhton suoh lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kamsang hon sawmngate in zong zui-in Jordan gei-ah a din laitahun ama gel tawh a kigamla deu-in kamsangte a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Elijah in a puontuol ladawhin ziel a, tua tawh tui a sat hi; tuol gumgaw-ah ama gel a galkai masangsie langkhat tuohah tua tui a kikhenzah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama gel a galkai zaw ciengun Elijah in Elisha kungah, “Nangma kung panin kei ei kilahto masangin nang adinga kang bawlpieh ding na dei ei gen in,” a ci hi. Elisha in, “Na hlagau tanh ni ei luosah in, hing thum ing,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in dawngkia a, “A hahsa na khat nang ngen hi; ahi vangin nang kung pana kei ei kilahto laitah nei mu leh na sil nget ang kipie ding hi; nei mu sih leh ang kipie lo ding hi” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lam pei kawmin ama gel a holim laitahun mei leeng khat le mei sakolte in ama gel khenkhe-in pumpei tawh vanah Elijah a kato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elisha in a et kawmin awng a, “Ka pa, ka pa! Israel leengte le a sakol tung tuongte!” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ama kimu thei nawn loin ama in a puonsilte manin ehkehin phal ni a suo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Elijah kung pana a kiesuh puontuol tungin a kilekia a, Jordan pieu-ah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in Elijah tung pana kie puontuol la-in tui sat a, “Elijah’ Pasien Topa hei sunga om ahiei?” a ci hi. Ama in tui a sat ciengin a lang khat tuohah tui kikhenin Elisha a galkai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jericho-a om kamsang honte in a gal mu ciengun, “Elisha tungah Elijah’ hlagau tu hi,” ci-in a tangko uhi. Ama tawh kimu dingin kuonin ama mai-ah a tuolkun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Tu-in en in, na nasemte lahah mi thahat sawmnga i nei uhi; amate sawl inlen na pupa suisah in, kang thum hi,” a ci uhi. Topa’ hlagau in ama domto-in muoltung khat ahi sihle hawhguom khat a a khiehsuh dawh khat hi va,” a ci uhi. Ama in thuhkia a, “Hi lo hi, amate sawl sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hizongnanle amate in a maizum dongin a gengen ciengun ama in, “Amate sawl un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n mihing sawmngate sawlin ni thum sung a sui vangun ama a mu zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate a kilekia ciengun (Jericho ah ama a om hi) ama in amate kungah, “Na kung vuah, ‘Pei sih un,’ hing ci hi lo ka mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu-in khuopi sunga mite in Elisha kungah, “Ka pu in na mu bangin tami khuopi opna pen mun hoi ahi hi; ahi vangin a tuineh hoi loin leitangah bangma pieng lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in, “Kuongkum a tha khat hing peipi unlen a sungah ci koi un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in zong ama kungah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuinah-ah ama pei-in a sungah ci sung a, “ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Tami tui a hoi-in ka bawl zo hi; tu-a patin tami tui pan sina hile, nausietna hile pieng nawn lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Elisha’ thugen tawh kizui-in tuni dongin tua tui khu tui hoi a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in khum mun panin Bethel a zuonto hi; lampi a peito laitahin khuopi pan naupang honkhat pei-in ama a zako vua, “Dawtol pa! peimang ta’n, dawtol pa! peimang ta’n,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama kinua hei-in amate a mu ciengin Topa’ min tawh amate a samsie hi. Tua ciengin gamlah panin vompi ni pei-in tua naupang sawmli le nite a ehmal sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama khum mun panin Carmel ah a peisuoh a, tua ciengin Samaria ah a peikia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpi Jehoshaphat’ kum sawm le gietna kumin Samaria sung Israel tungah Ahab’ tapa Jehoram in kumpi sem hi; ama kum sawm le ni sung a maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nu le a pa za-in ama a sie-a a gamtat lo vangin Topa muna-ah a sie-in a gamta hi, azieh pen ama in a pa na bawlsa Baal biehna song pen hemkhie tei sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in Israel a mawsah Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ mawna ma pomlai hi; tua panin ama kikoicing lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab kumpipa Mesha pen tuu khawi pa ahi a, ama in kum sielin Israel kumpipa tungah tuuno tul zakhat le tuutang zakhat’ mul pie zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ahab a si ciengin Moab kumpipa in Israel kumpipa a ledo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum hun laitahin Kumpi Jehoram in Samaria panin Israel mi zosie khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama pei-in Judah Kumpi Jehoshaphat kungah, “Moab kumpipa in kei ei ledo zo hi; Moab sim dingin kei tawh nang kuon diei mah?” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Kang kuon ding hi; nangma tawh kang omton a, ka mite nangma-a’ ahi a, ka sakolte zong nangma’ sakol ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Hei lamah i kuon diei?” ci-in dong hi. Jehoram in dawng a, “Edom senel gam zui-in i kuon ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel kumpipa, Judah kumpipa, le Edom kumpipa-te a kuon uhi; amate ni sagi sung a kuol pei zaw ciengun a galkapte ule a peipi uh a ganhingte adingin tui a om nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel kumpipa in, “Eh ka dei! Topa in ei kumpi thum teng Moab’ khut sunga pieh dinga ei na hlat ahi mawh vele,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jehoshaphat in, “Tam sungah Topa ei dawhpieh thei ding Topa’ kamsang khat beh a om sih amah?” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Israel kumpipa’ nasemte khat in, “Elijah’ khut tunga tuisung pa, Shaphat’ tapa Elisha tam sungah om hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehoshaphat in, “ Topa’ kammal in ama a ompi hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama kungah Israel kumpipa le Jehoshaphat le Edom kumpipa a hawsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elisha in Israel kumpipa kungah, “Nang tawh bang kisai ka hei? Na pa’ kamsangte ahi sihle na nu’ kamsangte kungah kipei ta’n,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin Israel kumpipa in ama kungah, “Hi lo hi; Moab kumpipa’ khut sungah ko kumpi thum teng pieh dinga ei hlanpa khu Topa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisha in, “A na ka seppieh Vanglien Topa a hing ahi ma bangin Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat a thusim lo khat hi poma leng ka mit hemin zong kang en sih ding a, a mu-in zong kang mu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle tumging tumsiem khat ei hlatpieh un,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin tumging siempa in a tumging a sai laitahin Topa’ vanglietna ama tungah a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Tami lui gawta pen tui ka dimsah ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Hui le guo na mu sih ding vua, ahi vangin nangma le na bawng honte le na gantate utawh na dawn dingin khum lui gawta pen tui ka dimsah ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam pen Topa muna-ah thuneu no khat ahi hi. Bang ding ahei cile ama in na khut sungah Moab-te zong ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangma in kulpi tawh a ki-im khuopi zosie le a kituomteel khuopi zosie na zo ding hi; singkung hoi zosie zong phua-in, tuinah zosie na kangsah ding a, leitang zosie suong tawh kidimsahin hawllei na suohsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A zing cieng zingmawng biehpieh hun pawl ciengin gamsung teng tui tawh a kidim masangin thakhatthu-in Edom lam panin tui luon a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate sim dingin kumpite kuonto zo ci thu Moab-te zosie in a zah ciengun a khang pen panin a vuoi pen dongin galvan sil thei zosie hlanin gamgi lamah a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zingmawng ciengin amate a thobai uleh nisa in tui tung khaw a, Moab-te in a galkhat lam vua om tui pen sisan bangin a sanin a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in, “Tami sisan ahi hi; kumpite khatlekhat kido-in khatlekhat kithat hi ngel ding hi. Tua ahi ciengin tu-in, Moab-te aw, van kinuasie teng va la ta vai!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate Israel’ giephuol a tun ciengun Israel-te dingin a mai vua a tai Moab-te a busim uhi; Moab gam a lut kawmun amate in a bansim toto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in khuopite a thalpaih vua, suong in a khucip dongin lei hoina gam zosie tungah mi zosie in suong a sep uhi; amate in a tuinah teng uh khahcipin singkung hoi zosie a phua sieng uhi. Kir-hareseth behah suongtum kulpite om a, saili tawi teng in kui-imin a busim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gal in ama lam a naw lam Moab kumpipa in a thei ciengin Edom kumpipa sontah phukeh dingin namsau tawi mi za sagi tawh a kuon hi; ahi vangin amate in a phukeh zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ama’ zaluo ding a tapa kai-in kul tungah meihal biehna-in a pie hi. Israel-te tungah a lien mama lungthahna tungin ama kung panin amate nuakinin a gam vuah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Elisha kungah kamsang honte lahah mi khat’ zi kiko a, “Na nasem ka pasal si hi; tuale na nasempa in Topa a zatah lam na thei a, ahi vangin ka tapa nite sila dinga la dingin a leibatna pa ang kuon hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elisha in tua nu kungah, “Nang adingin bang kang bawlpieh diei? Innah bang na nei ei, ei gen in?” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Na nasemnu in inn ah sathau bung khat ci longal bangma zamtawng a nei sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in, “A pulamah pei-in na vengte zosie’ beel hawm teng va kawm ta’nlen hing tawm kawm vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin sungtumin na tapate tawh kot kikhalu unlen, tam beel zosie sungah sung in; beel khat a dim sielin tuomkoi paipai in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum nu in ama nuasie-in a tapate tawh kot a kikhalu uhi; amate in tua nu kungah beelte a puohpuoh vua, tua nu in zong beel sungah na sungsung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beel teng a dim ciengin tua nu in a tapa kungah, “Beel dang khat ei pie in,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin a tapa in tua nu kungah, “Beel dang om nawn sih,” a ci hi. Tua bepin sathau a kang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua nu pei-in Pasien’ mipa kungah gen a, tuale ama in, “Pei in, tua sathau zua inlen na leiba sang in. Tua hile na zahmawh teng tawh nangma le na tapate na hing thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni khat Elisha in Shunem khuo nawhkha a, tua khuo sunga a teng a cithei numei khat in an ne dingin ama hlan hi. Tuaci’n ama in khum lam a nawh sielin khum sungah baangin an ne zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua nu in a pasal kungah, “En in, i lampi ang nawh zing tam mipa pen Pasien’ mi tahtah ahi lam ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eite kunga ang tun sielin innkhum tungah ama’ gie nadingin kawm a nei innmeng khat bawlpiehin, tua sungah ama dingin lupna khat, sabuoi khat, topha khat le meivah khat koipieh vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni khat ama tua mun a tun ciengin innkhan tungah kato-in a lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a nasempa Gehazi kungah, “Shunem numei hlan in,” a ci hi. Ama in tua numei a hlat ciengin ama mai-ah tua nu a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in tua mipa kungah, “Tua nu kungah gen in, ‘Ko adingin tam lunggimna zosie na thuoh hi. Nangma dingin bang kang bawlpieh diei? Kumpipa kungah ahi sihle galkapmangpa kungah nangma tangin thu khat popo ang kigenpieh ding na dei a om ei mah?’ ci in,” a ci hi. Tua nu in dawng a, “Keima’ mite lahah teng ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in, “Tua bang ahile ama dingin bang a kibawlpieh thei diei?” a ci hi. Gehazi in dawng a, “Thu khat beh om hi, ama in tapa nei loin a pasal lah vuoikawn zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in, “Tua nu hlan in,” a ci hi. Ama in tua numei a hlat zaw ciengin kotbieng ah tua nu a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “Khuovei tu bang hun ciengin tapa khat na tawi ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua nu in dawng a, “Hi lo hi, ka pu Pasien’ mipa aw; na nasemnu sol sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elisha in tua nu kungah a gensa bangin tua numei nau pai a, khuovei a hun a tun ciengin ama in tapa khat a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A nausen a gol ciengin ni khat a pa kung anlate lahah a va haw ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in a pa kungah, “Aw kadei, ka lutang na, ka lutang na!” a ci hi. A pa in a nasempa kungah, “A nu kungah va koi ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in domin a nu kungah peipi hi; a nu’ phei tungah sunkim dongin to a, tuale ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua nu kato-in Pasien’ mipa’ lupna tungah a siel a, kot khalu-in a nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua nu in a pasal hlanin, “Mallang tahin Pasien’ mipa kungah va haw-in kang kile pai thei nadingin nasemte khat le laa khat ei puoh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in, “Bang zieha tuni-a ama kunga haw ding na hei? Hladet ni lah hi lo, sabbath ni zong lah hi lo,” a ci hi. Tua nu in, “Hing hoi na va” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua nu in laa phaw pha-in a nasempa kungah, “Gan kinawsah in; kang gen sih nah leh muon peisah sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n tua nu pei a, Carmel Muol tunga Pasien’ mipa kung a tung hi. Pasien’ mipa in tua nu a pei a mu ciengin a nasempa Gehazi kungah, “En in, khum tahah Shunem numei khat ang pei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tua nu dawn dingin thakhatin va tai ta’nlen ama kungah, ‘Na dam ei mah? Na pasal a dam ei mah? Naupang a dam ei mah?’ va ci ta’n,” a ci hi. Tua nu in dawng a, “Hoi gawp na,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Muol tunga Pasien’ mipa kung a tun ciengin tua nu in a keng a tupom pai hi. Gehazi in sawnthop dingin tua nu a nai hi. Ahi vangin Pasien’ mipa in, “Ama tua ci opsah lel in; azieh pen ama a lung kham seng zieh ahi bo hi. Topa in keima kungah a thu ei imin keima kungah ang genkha sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua nu in, “Ka pu kungah ta pasal kang ngen amah? Kei ei puikhiel sin, hing ci hi lo ka mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in Gehazi kungah, “Na kawng gah inlen na khut sungah ka ciengkhut khunin pei ta’n. Mi khatpo tawh na kituo khah leh hopi sin len, mi khatpo in ang hopi le zong dawng sin; tuale naupang maitangah ka ciengkhut va nga ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua naupang’ nu in, “ Topa a hing ahi ma bangin nang lo tawh ka pei sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama dingin tua nu a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gehazi na mapei-in tua naupang tungah a ciengkhut a ngah vangin awging hileh hinna lim hile bangma om lo hi. Ama dawn dingin a kilekia a, tuale ama kungah, “Naupang khanglo nai lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Inn sungah Elisha a lut ciengin a lupna tungah a sisa-a a lum tua naupang a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama lut a, ama gel beh kot kikhalu-in Topa tungah thu a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin lupna tungah ama kato-in naupang tungah kingam a, naupang’ kam le ama’ kam tuo-in, a mit tungah ama’ mit omsah a, a khut tungah ama’ khut a omsah hi; ama tunga a zam phei laitahin naupang’ pum a lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama kumsuh kia-in innkhan sungah pei kawikawi a, tua ciengin ama kato-in naupang tungah a zamkia leuleu hi; naupang in sagivei hahthi loin a mit tegel hah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Elisha in Gehazi hlanin, “Shunem numei hlan in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n tua nu hlan hi. Tua nu a tun ciengin ama in, “Na tapa kilah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua nu pei-in a kephungah pua-in tuolah a kunsuh hi; tua ciengin ama in a tapa la-in a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Gilgal-ah Elisha a kilekia ciengin khum gam sungah kiel a tung hi. Ama mai-ah kamsang honte a to laitahun ama in a nasempa kungah, “Beelpi suong inlen kamsangte adingin me huon in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Me sui dingin amate lahah khat gamlahah a pei hi; ama in gam-um gui khat mu-in a puontuol dimin tua gam umga loin kilekia a, tuate bang ahei ci thei lopi-in atnenin mebeel sungah bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate in mite neh dingin an a thua uhi. Ahi vangin me a neh laitahun, “Pasien’ mipa aw, beel sungah si theina gu om!” ci-in a kiko uhi. Amate in an a ne thei ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama in, “Tua ahile an themkhat hing la un,” a ci hi. Ama in beel sungah tua an pai a, “Mite neh dingin an lui-in nesah un,” a ci hi. Tuale beel sungah neh thei lo ding bangma a om nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Baal-shalishah panin mi khat pei-in Pasien’ mipa kungah anpal anlum, mangbuham lum sawmni, le bupal vuitha a ip sungah guongin a peipi hi. Elisha in, “A neh dingun tam sunga mite pie un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ahi vangin a nasempa kungah, “Mi zakhat mai-ah tami bang ka ci lui thei ding ahei?” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in, “Mite pie inlen nesah in. Azieh pen Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Amate in ne-in themkhat val lai ding hi,’ ci hi,” cikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ama in a mai vuah tuate lui-in amate in a ne vua, Topa’ gensa bangin pawlkhat a val lai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aram kumpipa’ galkapmang Naaman pen mi thupi le a pupa’ maipha nga mipa khat ahi hi. Bangzieh ahei cile ama tungtawnin Topa in Aram-te guolzawna a pie hi. Ama pen a thahat galhang khat ahi vangin phah natna a vei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu-in a galsimna khat vuah Aram-te in Israel gam panin ngahnuno khat manin tua nu in Naaman zi’ na semin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a pi kungah, “Samaria-a kamsangpa kungah ka pu va haw leh ci tei ing e! Ama in a phah natna damsah thei ngelngel va,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Naaman pei-in Israel gam pana numeino’ thugente a pu kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aram kumpipa in, “Tua ahile va pei ta’nlen, Israel kumpipa tungah lai khat ka hlah ding hi,” a ci hi. Ama kuonin ngun talent sawm, kham shekel tulguh le pawi puon sawm a keng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Israel kumpipa kungah tua laihlah keng a, tua sungah, “Tami laihlah na nga ciengin a phah natna na damsah nadingin na kunga ka nasempa Naaman kang sawlna thu thei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in tua laihlah a sim ciengin a puon ehkeh a, “Mi khat’ phah natna a damsah dingin tam mipa in kei tungah thu ei vaihlah thei nadingin kei mi that thei ahi sihle mi hingsah thei Pasien ka hi amah? En un, keima tawh kihau nading a hanciem ahi lam thei un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanle Israel kumpipa in a puonte a balkehna thu Pasien’ mipa Elisha in a zah ciengin kumpipa kungah mi sawl a, “Bang dinga na puon na balkeh va-ia ahei? Ama in Israel gam sungah kamsang a op lam a thei nadingin ka kungah ama hing peisah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n a sakolte le a sakol leengte tawh Naaman pei-in Elisha inn kotbiengah a khawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elisha in ama kungah kamtai khat sawlin, “Pei inlen, Jordan gun sungah sagivei va kisil ta’n. Tua hile na ci na sa a ngai bangkia-in na siengtho ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Naaman lungthahin peikhie a, “Keima kungah ama pel loin hing pei-in hing ding vanin, a Pasien Topa’ min hing lo vanin, ka ciphah tungah a khut hing zahin ka phah natna hing damsah va, ci-a ka ngaisut hi bo a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel tui zosie sangin Damascus gama Abana le Pharpar gunte hoizaw peh hi lo amah? tuate sungah kisilin ka sieng thei sih ding amah?” a ci hi. Ama kihei-in a lungthahsa-in a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin a nasemte in ama nai-in ama kungah, “Ka pu aw, kamsangpa in sil hamsa khat bawl dinga ang sawl le zong na bawl ding hi lo amah? Ama in nangma kungah, ‘Kisil inlen siengtho in,’ ci-in tam thu zosie ang gen pen nang in na bawl dingin bangza-in hoizaw kanlai ding ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama peisuhin Pasien’ kamsangpa genna tawh kizui-in Jordan gun sungah sagivei a kiphum hi; naupangno cilesa bangin ama’ cilesa a ngai bangkia-in a sieng sitset hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien’ mipa kungah ama le a pawlte zosie a kilekia uhi; ama pei-in a mai-ah ding a, “Tu-in ahile Israel gam sung khat beh simlo, leitung mundang zosie-ah Pasien a om lo lam ka thei zo hi; hepina tawh na nasempa tung panin letsong khat ei sanpieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, “A na ka seppieh Topa a hing ahi ma bangin bangma ka sang sih ding hi!” a ci hi. Ama in a san nadingin a paugen vangin ama in a khia veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua bepin Naaman in, “Tua ahi vawt leh hepina tawh laa-sakol ni puoh khop ding leitang ei piesah in; bangzieh ahei cile na nasempa in Topa tung simlo, pasien dangte khat popo tungah meihal biehna hile, biehpiehna hile pie nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanle tami thu khat tungah, “ Topa in na nasempa’ mawna ei maisah in: Rimmon inn sunga bie dingin tua munah ka pupa a tum ciengin, ka ban tungah ama kingamin Rimmon inn sungah ka kun hi. Rimmon inn sunga ka kun ciengin Topa in tami thu khat tungah na nasempa ei maisah taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in tua pa kungah, “Nuomtahin pei in,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ama kung panin Naaman pei-in a gamla lo mun khat a tun ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasien’ mipa Elisha’ nasem Gehazi in, “Aram-te Naaman in ama a pieh nate ka pupa in sang loin tua mipa peisah mawh hi. Topa a hing ahi ma bangin ama nuadelin ama kung panin na themkhat beh ka nga ding hi,” ci-in a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n Gehazi in Naaman a nuadel hi. Mi khat in ama a nuadel lam Naaman in a mu ciengin ama dawn dingin a sakol leeng tung panin ama kumsuh a, “Bangkim a hoi hi sam va izaw?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in dawng a, “A unpi-in hoi hi. Hizongle ka pu in, ‘Ephraim muoltung gam panin keima kungah kamsangte ni tu mama-in ang tung uhi; hepina tawh amate ngun talent khat le pawi puon sil ni pie in,’ ci-a a gen dingin kei ei sawl hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naaman in, “Hepina tawh talent ni sang tamai ve,” a ci hi. Ama in a san thei nadingin kun a, ippi ni-in ngun talent ni khi-in pawi puon ni tawh, a nasem mihing nite pie-in Gehazi’ mai-ah tuate puosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khuosung kulpi a tun ciengun ama in amate kung panin ippite la-in tuate inn sungah a khol hi; ama in tua mite sawldawh a, tuale amate zong a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama sungtumin a pupa mai-ah a ding hi; tuale Elisha in ama kungah, “Gehazi, nang hei-a haw na hiei?” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Na nasempa heima sungah pei sing,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanle ama in tua pa kungah, “Nang ang dawn ding mi khat hing kumsuhin nang tawh ka hlagau zawhton hi lo amah? Sum le puonsilte, olive umte le lengga lote, tuute le bawngtangte, nasem numeite le nasem pasalte san ding hun ahi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin nangma le na suonlehlahte tungah Namaan’ phah natna a tu den ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n vua bangin Hehazi vamin a phahsa-in Elisha kung panin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in kamsang honte in Elisha kungah, “Na theisa bangin nangma’ khut nei-a ka opna mun uh kote adingin kuocih luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jordan-ah keima ei peisah inlen, tuanah singluong khat ciet puo-in ka ten nading uh mun khat ei bawlsah in,” a ci uhi. Ama in dawngin, “Tua bangin bawl un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate khat in, “Na nasemte tawh hing kuon in, kang thum hi,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in dawng a, “Hing kuon na vang,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n a nasemte tawh ama a kuon hi. Jordan a tun ciengun sing a phua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi khat in singluong a phua laitahin tui sungah a heitang a kiehsuo hi; ama awngin, “Ehei, Ka pupa! Tami hei zong mi-a’ kikawm ahi bo’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien’ mipa in, “Hei sunga kiesuh ahiei?” a ci hi. Ama in a kiehna mun ama kungah a hil ciengin ama in ciengkang khat sattanin tua sontahah sepin a heitang a lamtosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in, “La to aw,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in a khut tawh zamin tuami heitang a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khatvei Aram kumpipa le Israel a kido ciengun ama in a uliente kuppi hi. Ama in, “Khum mun khum munah ka giephuol ka sat ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien’ mipa in Israel kumpipa kungah thu puoh a, “Aram-te ang peisuh ding ahi ziehin tami mun na nawh khah lo nadingun kidawm un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in Pasien’ mipa genna munah kam vaihlah hi. Amate a kigalgin thei nadingun khatvei nivei sanga a tamzaw thu hilkhol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin Aram kumpipa patau mama hi; ama in a uliente hlanin amate kungah, “Tu-in ei gen un, eite lahah Israel kumpipa lama a pang koi na hi vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin a uliente khat in, “Ka pu, kumpipa, koima pang sih. Israel gama om kamsang Elisha in Israel kumpipa kungah na lupna tunga na thugente a na gen sawn ahi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in, “Va pei ta’nlen ama hei sunga om ahei va sui ta’n.; keima in mi sawlin ama ka mansah ding hi,” a ci hi. Ama kungah, “Dothan-ah ama om hi,” ci-in kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in tua munah sakolte le sakol leengte le galkap hon tampite sawl hi; zan lai-in amate pei-in tua khuopi a kui-im pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zingmawngin Pasien mipa’ nasem khat thobai-in a pei leh khuopi kimkot zosie-ah sakolte le sakol leengte tawh galkap honpi a om hi. A nasempa in, “Ehei, pu! Bang i ci ta diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a dawngkia a, “Zau sin, bangzieh ahei cile amate tawh a omte sangin eite tawh a omte tamzaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Elisha in tam bangin thu ngen hi: “ Topa aw, ama in khuo a mu thei nadingin a mit honpieh in, kang thum hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Topa in nasempa’ mitte honpiehin ama in khuo a mu hi; Elisha’ kimvel zosie-a muol tungah sakolte le meikuong sakol leengte a dimin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama do dingin Aram-te a kuonsuh uh ciengin Elisha in Topa kungah thu ngen a, “Tam mite mittawtna tawh vatmai in, kang thum hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Elisha’ nget bangin ama in mittawtna tawh amate a vatmai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Elisha in amate kungah, “Tam pen a lampi ahi sih a, tam zong a khuopi ahi sih hi; ei zui un, na sui uh mipa kungah kang peipi ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in Samaria ah amate a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samaria ah amate a lut behun Elisha in, “ Topa aw, tam mite in khuo a mu thei nadingun amau’ mit honpieh in,” a ci hi. Topa in a mit uh honpieh a, Samaria khuo sunga a om lam uh a kithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in amate a mu bepin Elisha kungah, “Ka pa, amate ka that diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in dawng a, “That sin! Na thasawm mite, na namsau le na thalpi tawh na mat ahi son amah? Amate in an ne-in tui a dawn thei nadingun amai vuah an le tui lui in; tuale a pu uh kungah amate peisah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in ama adingin pawi lienpi khat bawlpieh hi; amate in an ne-in tui a dawn zaw ciengun a lampi vuah amate a peisah a, tuale a pupa kung zuonin a pei uhi. Tuale Israel gam sung a sim dingin Aram-te a kuon nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zaw hun khat ciengin Aram kumpipa Ben-hadad in a galkap zosie khawm hi; Samaria do ding le a kuikhum dingin ama a kuonto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in a kuikhum den ziehun Samaria-ah kiel nasie mama a, laa lutang khat ngun shekel sawmgiet, gam kaisuon hai khat seli-suo-sekhat ngun shekel nga-in a kizua dongin kielpi a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kulpi tungah Israel kumpipa a pei laitahin ama kungah numei khat kiko a, “Ei panpi ven, ka pu kumpipa!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in, “Hi lo hi! Topa kipanpisah zaw in. Ke’n nang bang kang ci panpi thei kan ding ahei? Ancilna phuol pan ahi sihle lengga tui suhna pana kang panpi ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa in tua nu dong a, “Na lungkhamna bang ahiei?” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Tam numei in ka kungah, ‘Na tapa ei pie in; tuni-in ama i ne ding a, kei tapa zing ciengin i ne ding hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka tapa’ sa huonin ka ne uhi. A zing ciengin ama kungah, ‘Na tapa ei pie in, a sa i ne ding hi,’ ka ci hi. Hizongle tua nu in a tapa a na phuolmang ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kumpipa in tua numei’ thugen a zah ciengin a puonte a ehkeh hi; ama khuopikul tunga a pei laitah ahi ziehin mite in a pumpi nei lamah la-ip puon a sil lam a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in, “Tu ni-in Shaphat’ tapa Elisha’ lutang a liengko tunga a op sih tah ma leh Pasien in kei ei dawm sih hinlen, a nasie zaw-in ei bawl lai heh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in ama mai-ah mi khat a sawl hi. Tu-in a inn sungah Elisha to a, ama tawh upate a to ton laitah ahi hi. Kamtaipa a tun masangin Elisha in upate kungah, “Tam mithat pa in ka lu tan dingin mi khat ang sawl lam na thei vuoi mah? Kamtai pa ang tun ciengin kot khah unlen, ama lang khatah kotpi tucip un. Ama nua-ah a pu’ ketot ging kiza hi lo amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate tawh a holim laitahin ama kungah kumpipa peisuh a, “Tami gimna Topa kung pan ahi hi! Bang dingin Topa sungah kinem na lai ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahi vangin Elisha in, “ Topa’ kammal za in: Tam bangin Topa in gen a, zing cieng tu bang hunin Samaria kul tunkotah annel law khat shekel khatin kizua ding a, mangbuham law ni shekel khatin kizua ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa a khuta a kingapna galkap bupa in Pasien’ mipa kungah, “ Topa in vantung tawlette nangawn hong nanle tam bang pieng thei ding amah?” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ama in, “Na mit tawh na mu ding a, ahi vangin na ne kha sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua laitahin khuopi tunkot pulamah miphah li om a, amate khatlekhat in, “Bang dinga i si tanpha vua tam sunga mawh toto ding i hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Khuopi sungah lut vai,’ ci lei lah khuopi sungah kielpi tung a, tua munah i si ding uhi; tam sungah to den vai ci lei lah a si veve ding i hi uhi. Tua ahi ziehin Aram-te’ giephuolah va pei vai; amate in ei mawh hingkhawi khah uleh i hing ding a, ei tha ule lah a si veve ding ma i hi lel uhi,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n nitum kuonin Aram-te’ phuolah a pei uhi; ahi vangin Aram-te’ phuol mong a tun uleh tua munah koima a na om nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in sakol leengte, sakolte le galkap honpi husate Aram galkapte zasahin amate khatlekhat in, “Israel kumpipa in ei do dingin Hit kumpite le Egypt kumpite ciel hi,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n ni tum kuonin amate tai-in a puonbuhte uh, a sakolte ule a laate uh nuasie-in a hinna a taipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam miphahte giephuol mong a tun ciengun puonbuh khat sungah lutin an ne tui dawnin a om vua, ngun, kham, le puonsilte tomgamin tuate a phuol uhi. Tua ciengin peikia-in puonbuh dang khatah a lut vua, khum panin zong vante tuo-in tuate a phuol leuleu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate khatlekhat a kiho vua, “I sepzie uh man lo hi. Tuni pen kipah ni ahi hi; bangma gen loin i dai op vua, zingmawng khuova dong i nga uleh gimna i thuoh ding uhi; tua ziehin va pei-in kumpipa’ innkuonte kungah va gen ta vai,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate zong pei-in khuopi tunkot cingte a ko vua, tuale amate kungah, “Aram-te’ giephuol ka va haw ta vua, khum sungah a kikhi sakolte le laate le a bang banga om puonbuhte simlo, koima kimu kha lo a, koima’ husa zong kiza loin bangma dang om lo hi,” ci-in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin tunkot cingte kiko-in kumpipa’ innkuonte kungah tam thu a tangko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zanin kumpipa tho-in a nasemte kungah, “Aram-te in ei do dinga a kisah dan uh kang gen ding hi. Amate in i kiel lam a thei uhi; tuaci’n amate gamlahah a kiphuol dingin giephuol a nuasie vua, ‘Khuopi panin ang pei ciengun amate hing matin khuopi sungah i lut ding hi,’ ci-in a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nasemte khat in, “Tam sunga kinuasie teng in a sisa Israel mihonpi ma bangin thuoh veve ding ahi ziehin mi pawlkhat in a omlai sakolte sung panin nga kaisah hi; amate sawlin en phot vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in sakol tung tuong mi ni hlanin kumpipa in Aram galkapte nua-ah amate sawl a, “Pei unlen va thei ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama gel in Jordan dong a del uhi; lam dung tengah Aram-te a kinaw na lam vua a kiehsah uh puonte le vanzahte a na kithethang ziezuo hi. Tuaci’n kamtaite kinuale-in kumpipa kungah a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin mite pei-in Aram-te’ giephuol a bulu uhi. Tuaci’n Topa gensa dung zui-in annel law khat shekel khatin kizua a, mangbuham law ni shekel khatin kizua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu-in kumpipa in a khuta a kingapna galkap bupa pen tunkot uh dingin koi hi; ama kungah kumpipa a peisuh lai-in Pasien’ mipa thugensa bang lien ma-in mite in a si dongin tunkotah ama a tuoncil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien’ mipa in kumpipa kungah, “Zing cieng tu bang hunin Samaria tunkotah mangbuham law ni shekel khatin kizua ding a, annel law khat shekel khatin kizua ding hi,” a ci ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />galkap bupa in Pasien’ mipa dawng a, “ Topa in vantung tawlette nangawn hong nanle tam bang pieng thei ding amah?” a ci hi. Tuale ama in dawngin, “Na mit tawh na mu ding a, hinanle na nekha sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua bang ma-in ama tungah tung tahpi hi; mite in tunkotah ama tuoncilin a si hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Elisha in a tapa a hinkiasah numei kungah, “Tho-in na innkuon tawh pei inlen, na ten theina mun khat popo-ah teng in; azieh pen Topa in kielpi khat tunsah ding thupie zo a, gam sungah kum sagi sung kielpi tung ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n tua numei dingin Pasien’ mipa thugen bangin gamta hi; a innkuon tawh tua nu pei-in Philistia-te gamah kum sagi sung a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sagi a cin zaw, Philistia-te gam panin tua numei a kinuale ciengin, a inn le a leitang ngen dingin kumpipa kungah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua laitahin Pasien’ mipa nasem ahi Gehazi le kumpipa kiho a, “Elisha’ sepsa na lien zosie ei gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Elisha in a sisa mi a hinsah kiana thu kumpipa kungah a gen laitahin, a tapa a hinkiasah numei in a inn le a leitang ngen dingin kumpipa kungah a pei hi. Gehazi in, “Ka pu, kumpipa aw, tam sungah a numei om a, Elisha in a hinkiasah a tapa zong tam sungah om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa in numei kungah tua thu a dawh ciengin ama in a gen hi. Tuaci’n kumpipa in tua nu adingin ulien khat koi a, “Leitang a nuasie ni-a patin tuhun dong lo pana a pieng phiengsie zosie tawh ama-a’ teng a unpi-in piekia in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpi Ben-hadad a cinat laitahin Damascus-ah Elisha a pei hi. Ama kungah, “Pasien’ mipa tam sungah ang pei hi,” ci-in a kigen ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />kumpipa in Hazael kungah, “Letsong khat kengin Pasien’ mipa dawn dingin va pei ta’n. Ama tungtawnin Topa tungah, ‘Tam natna panin ka damkia na diei,’ ci-in va dong ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama dawn dingin Damascus-a pieng na hoi nam tuomtuom kalaoh sawmli puohkhop letsong kengin Hazael a kuon hi. Ama lutin ama mai-ah a din ciengin ama in, “Na tapa Aram Kumpipa Ben-hadad in nang kungah ei sawl a, “Tami natna panin ka damkia na diei,’ ci hi,” a ci hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elisha in, “Pei inlen ama kungah gen in, ‘Na damkia valon ding hi,’ va ci ta’n; hinanle ama a si valon nading thu Topa in kei kungah ei lah zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama a zalat dongin mit phe loin Elisha in Hazael a encien hi. Tua bepin Pasien’ mipa a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hazael in, “Ka pu, bang dinga kap na hiei” ci-in dong hi. Ama in dawng a, “Azieh pen Israel mite tunga na bawl ding sietna ka thei hi; nang in a kulpite uh mei tawh na hal ding a, a tangvalte uh namsau tawh thatin, a naupangnote uh lei denna-in na nei ding hi, tuale naupaai lai numeite’ gil na kheipieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hazael in, “Ui bang bep lel na nasempa tami sil thupi bawl dingin bang ahi ahei?” a ci hi. Elisha in dawng a, “Aram tunga nang kumpi na hi nading thu Topa in kei kungah ei lah zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Elisha nuasie-in ama kungah, “Elisha in bang ang gen ei?” a ci a pupa Ben-hadad kung a tung hi. Tuale ama in dawngin, “Ama in na damkia valon nading thu kei kungah ei gen hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hizongle a zing ciengin a netpha la-in tui sungah die a, kumpipa a si dongin ama in a mai-ah tua puon a zah hi. Tuale Hazael in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel kumpi Ahab’ tapa Joram a kum ngana kumin Judah Kumpi Jehoshaphat’ tapa Jehoram maan ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpi a suo hunin kum sawmthum le ni pha a, ama in kum giet sung Jerusalem uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahab’ tanu ama’ zi ahi ziehin Ahab innkuonte’ gamtatsa bangin Israel kumpite’ lampi ma a zui hi. Topa’ mitmu-in a sie-in ama a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanle ama in ama le a suonlehlahte tungah tawntung meivah khat pieh dingin kam ciem zo ahi ziehin a nasempa David ziehin Topa in Judah a susie nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama hun sungin Edom-te in Judah’ uhna a ledo vua, amau’ aituom kumpi khat koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jehoram in a sakol leeng zosie tawh Zair-ah a galkai hi. Ama zanin kuon a, ama a imtawm Edom-te le sakol leeng bupate a busim hi; ahi vangin inn ah a galkapte a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n tuni dongin Edom-te in Judah gam uhna a ledo uhi. Khum hun ma-in Libnah in zong a ledo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu-in Jehoram’ gamtatna a omlai teng le ama sep zosie, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pu a pate tawh Jehoram lumton a, David’ khuopi sungah kivui hi; a tapa Ahaziah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel kumpi Ahab’ tapa Joram a kum sawm le nina kumin Judah kumpi Jehoram’ tapa Ahaziah maan ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A maan a kipatin Ahaziah kum sawmni le ni pha hi; ama kum khat sung Jerusalem ah maang hi. Ama’ nu min Athaliah ahi a, Israel kumpi Omri’ tunu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama Ahab’ innkuonte’ mahpa ahi ziehin Ahab’ innkuonte gamtat ma bangin Topa mitmu-in a sie-in gamta a, Ahab innkuonte’ lampi ma a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ramoth-gilead ah Aram kumpipa Hazael sim dingin Ahab’ tapa Joram tawh Ahaziah a kuonton uhi. Tua tahah Aram-te in Joram a liemsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rama ah Aram kumpipa Hazael tawh a kidona vuah Aram-te in ama a liemsahna uh liemmate kem dingin Jezreel ah kumpi Joram a kilekia hi. Jezreel ah Ahab’ tapa Joram a liem ziehin ama a ve dingin Judah kumpi Jehoram’ tapa Ahaziah a kuonsuh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin kamsang Elisha in kamsang honte lah panin khat hlanin ama kungah, “Na kawng gah inlen, tami sathau bung tawi-in Ramoth-gilead ah va haw ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na tun ciengin khumnah Nimshi’ tapa Jehoshaphat, a tapa Jehu sui in; a sungah lutin a guolte lahah kaikhie inlen, innkhan sungtawng khatah lutpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin sathau um la-in a lu tungah sungsuh inlen, ‘ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Israel tunga kumpi sem dingin sathau kang nu hi,’ ci hi,” va ci ta’n. Tua ciengin kot hong inlen tai in; khuomuong sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Ramoth-gilead ah kamsang tangvalpa a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Galkap bute in kikupna a nei laitahun ama tung a, tuale ama in, “Galkap bupa aw, nang adingin thu khat kang puoh hi,” a ci hi. Jehu in, “Kote lahah koi pen gen a kinei na hei?” ci-in a dong hi. Galkap bupa, nang ang gen ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jehu dingin inn sungah lut hi; tangvalpa in a lu tungah sathau sungin ama kungah, “Israel Pasien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Keima in Topa’ mite ahi Israel tunga kumpi sem dingin nang sathau kang nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jazebel tungah ka nasem kamsangte’ sisan le Topa nasem zosie’ sisan phu ka lah thei nadingin na pupa Ahab’ innkuon na satlia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen Ahab’ innkuon zosie a mangthai ding hi; keima in Israel sungah Ahab’ innkuon panin pasal poma, sal hile, sal lo hile ka sumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ innkuon le Ahijah’ tapa Baasha’ innkuon bangin Ahab innkuon ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jezreel gam sungah uite in Jezebel’ sa a ne ding vua, koima in ama vui lo ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin kot hongin ama a taimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pu’ nasemte kungah Jehu a tunkia ciengin amate in a kungah, “Bangkim a hoi ma ahiei mah? Bang hing bawla tua mimaw pa na kunga hing haw ahiei?” a ci uhi. Ama in a kung vuah, “Tam mipa dan le a thugen bielbualte na thei uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in, “Mi zuou pa! Ko ei gen in!” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n ama in, “ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Israel tunga kumpi dingin keima in nang sathau kang nu hi,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in zong mallangtahin a puonte uh suo-in kalei tungnung pen ah a pha uhi; tuale pengkul mutin, “Jehu, kumpi hi,” ci-in a tangtawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Nimshi’ tapa Jehoshaphat, a tapa Jehu in Joram a sawmdap hi. Aram kumpi Hazael langpangin Ramoth-gilead ah Israel zosie tawh khuo cingin Joram a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ahi vangin Aram kumpipa Hazael tawh a kido lai-a Aram-te in a liemsahna liemma a kem dingin Jezreel- ah kumpi Joram kilekia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jehu a sakol-leeng tungah tuongin a dam lo lupmun tung a ngah Joram opna Jezreel ah haw hi. Joram ve dingin Judah kumpi Ahaziah na tungsuh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jezreel ah galvil pa khat tausang tungah ding a, tuale ama in Jehu’ pawlte a tun laitah mu a, “Mi honkhat ka mu hi,” a ci hi. Joram in, “Sakol tung tuong mi khat la-in, amate dawn dingin sawl inlen, ‘Thu hoi ahiei mah?’ cisah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama dawn dingin sakol tung tuong pa pei-in ama in, “Kumpipa in tam bangin gen hi, ‘Thu hoi-a hing haw na hi uh amah,’ ci hi,” a ci hi. Jehu in dawngkia a, “Thuhoi le nang bang kisai na hei? Ka nua ei zui in,” a ci hi. Tua galvil pa in thu zasahin, “Kamtai pa in amate kung pha napi ama ang kilekia ta sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in sakol tung tuong a nina pa sawlin a kung vuah pei a, “Kumpipa in tam bangin gen hi: ‘Thuhoi-a hing haw na hi uh amah?’ ci hi,” a ci hi. Jehu in dawng a, “Thuhoi le nang bang kisai na hei? Ka nua ei zui in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Galvil pa in thu zasahkia a, “Ama in amate kung pha napi ama kilekia nawn lo hi. Nimshi’ tapa Jehu’ leeng hawl dan tawh kibang hi; azieh pen ama in mimaw bangin a hawl hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joram in, “Kithawi un,” a ci hi. Amate in a sakol leeng a guonpieh uhi. Tua ciengin Israel kumpi Joram le Judah kumpi Ahaziah, a sakol leeng tuoh vuah tuongin a dingkhie uhi; amate zong Jehu tawh kimu dingin a kuon vua, ama tawh Jezreel mi Naboth’ lo-ah a kimu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joram in Jehu a mu ciengin, “Jehu, thuhoi-a hing haw na hiei mah?” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Na nu Jezebel’ bum le aisanna le numei pahtatte a op laisie bang thuhoi om thei ding ahei,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin a sakol kamkai lehei-in Joram tai a, Ahaziah kungah, “Ahaziah, kumpi suon sawm!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jehu in a tha nei za tawh a thalpi kuoi-in ama’ lungtang sontah pailet dingin Joram’ liengko kikal kap hi; tuale a sakol leeng sungah ama a tumsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jehu in ama a hupa Bidkar kungah, “Domto inlen Jezreel-te Naboth’ neisa leitangah pai in; azieh pen a pa Ahab nua-ah nang le kei, kimai kimin i tuonton lai-in ama langpangin Topa in tami thuphuon a gen phawh in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Zani-in Naboth’ sisan le a tapate’ sisan ka mu ziehin tami leitang tung tehteh-ah kang thuh ding hi, ci-in ka kiciem hi,’ Topa in ci hi. Tua ahi ziehin Topa’ thugen dung zui-in tu-in ama domto inlen, tua leitang tungah ama pai in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judah kumpi Ahaziah in tua thu a mu ciengin Beth-haggan lamah a tai hi. Jehu in ama nuadel a, “Ama zong kap un!” a ci hi. Ibleam gei, Gur katona sontah sakol leeng tungah amate in ama a kap uhi. Tua ciengin Megiddo ah ama tai-in tua munah a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A uliente in Jerusalem ah sakol leeng khat tawh ama a puo vua, David’ khuopi sunga ama’ hanah a pu a pate tawh a vuiton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahab’ tapa Joram a kum sawm le khatna kumin Ahaziah in Judah tungah maan ding kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jezree ah Jehu a tun ciengin Jezebel in tam thu na za hi; tua nu in a mitte zutin a lu zem a, tawlet panin a khuodah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tunkot-ah Jehu a lut laitahin ama in, “Nang Zimri, na pu that pa, thu hoi-a hing haw na hiei mah?” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in tawlet lam ento-in, “Kei lamah koi teng na om vuoi? Koi e?” a ci hi. Numeite a uh cilgesa pasal ni ahiei thum ahiei in ama a ensuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in, “Tua nu hing sepsuh un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in tua nu a sepsuh uhi; ama’ sisan kimkhat kawm tung le sakolte tungah kithethang a, tuaci’n ama a tuoncil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama sung tumin an ne-in tui a dawn hi; ama in, “A kisamsie numei enin va vuibawl ta un; azieh pen ama kumpipa’ tanu ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanle tua nu vui dinga a pei ciengun amate in a lugu, a kephang le a khutphang cite simlo bangma dang a mu nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate kilekia-in Jehu kungah a gen ciengun ama in, “Tam pen a nasempa, Tishbe mi Elijah tung tawna Topa na gensa ahi hi: ‘Jezreel gam sungah uite in Jezebel’ sa a ne ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />koima in, ‘Tami Jezebel ahi hi,’ a ci thei lo nadingin Jezreel gam sunga lolai-ah Jezebel’ luonghawm ehlei bang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Samaria ah Ahab in tapa sawm sagi nei hi. Tuaci’n Jehu in lai gielin Samaria-a teng Jezreel uliente tung, upate tung le Ahab’ tapate a cingte tungah tua laite hlahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Note tawh na pu uh’ tapate omin na dei bang vua na zah thei uh sakol leengte le sakolte, kul tawh a ki-im khuopite le galvante na nei ziehun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />na pu’ tapate lahah a hoipen khat teelin a pa’ kumpi topha tungah tosah unlen, na pupa’ innkuon adingin gal sim un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate a zau mama vua, “En un, kumpi nite nangawn in ama nang zo lo hi; tua ahile eite in bang i ci nan zo mawh ding ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpi innsung vaipuo pa le khuopi uhpa in upate le a cingte tawh Jehu kungah kam vaihlahin, “Kote nangma’ nasemte ka hi uhi; na gen popo ka sem ding uhi. Koima khat beh kumpi-in ka bawl sih ding uhi; hoi na sah bangin kibawl in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jehu in amate kungah laihlah a nina gielkia a, “No kei lamah ang omin ka thu mang dingin a baisa-in na op uleh na pu uh’ tapate’ lutang la unlen, zing cieng tu bang hunin Jezreel-a ka kungah hing peipi ta un,” a ci hi. Tu-in kumpipa’ tapa sawm sagite pen amate a khansuo khuopi uliente tawh a omton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate kungah a laihlah a tun ciengin kumpipa’ tapa sawm sagite manin a that uhi; bawng sungah amau’ lutang a guong vua, Jezreel-a Jehu kungah a hlah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kamtaipa pei-in ama kungah, “Amate in kumpipa tapate’ lutang ang puo zo ta uhi,” ci-in a gen ciengin ama in, “Zingmawng dongin tunkot lutna-ah lom ni-in koi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zingmawngin ama a pusuo ciengin dingin mi zosie kungah, “Note pen maw peng na hi uhi. Ka pupa sawmdapin a that keima ka hi hi. Hinanle tam teng zosie a satlum koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ahab’ innkuon tawh kisai-in Topa in a gen thu, Topa’ kammal khat zong tuolah kie lo ding hi, ci-in thei un; azieh pen a nasempa Elijah tung tawna a gensa thu Topa in sem zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jehu in koima hen nei lo za dongin Jezreel khuo sunga Ahab’ innkuon a om sun teng, ulien zosie, a lawm it zosie, le siempu zosie that sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama dingin Samaria ah a pei hi. Lamkal, Tuucingte opna ahi Beth-eked a tun ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jehu in Judah kumpipa Ahaziah’ sanggamte mu-in, ama in, “No koi na hi vuoi?” a ci hi. Amate in a dawng vua, “Kote Ahaziah’ tanaute ka hi uhi; Jezreel-a om kumpipa’ tapate le kumpinu’ tapate kunga haw dinga ang kuonsuh ka hi uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in, “Amate hingmat in,” a ci hi. Amate in tua mite hingmat in, Beth-eked dum sungah mi sawmli le ni that hi; ama in koima khat beh a hingkhawi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in khum mun a nuasie ciengin ama dawn dinga a pei Rekhab’ tapa Jehonadab tawh kituoh hi; Jehu in tuapa hopi-in ama kungah, “Nang tungah ka lungtang a thuman bangin, kei tungah na lungtang a thuman ei mah?” a ci hi. Jehonadab in dawng a “Man hi,” a ci hi. Jehu in, “Tua ahile na khut ei hlah in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in a khut a hlah hi. Jehu in sakol leeng tungah ama kaito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “Kei ei zui inlen, Topa ading ka deiluotna hing en in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in a sakol leeng tungah ama a tuongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samaria a tun ciengin Topa in Elijah kunga a gensa dung zui-in Jehu in amate a suh maimang dongin Samaria-a om Ahab’ innkuonpi a omlai teng zosie a that sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jehu in mi zosie khawmtuo-in amate kungah, “Ahab in Baal’ na themkhat sem hi; ahi vangin Jehu in tam semzaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in Baal kamsangte zosie le a siempu zosie ka kungah hing sawl un; koima pelemsah sih un; azieh pen keima in Baal tungah kithoina thupi khat ka nei ding hi; a pelem poma kihingkhawi lo ding hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin Jehu in Baal bie mi zosie a suh maimang thei nadinga ngian tawh a bawl ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jehu in thu pie a, “Baal ading a thupi kikhopna siengtho khat bawl un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in a tangko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pei lo koima khat beh om loin Baal bie mi zosie a pei nadingin Jehu in Israel gam sung zosie-ah thu a zasah hi; Baal a bie zosie a pei vua, a pei lo mi khat zong om lo hi. Baal biehinn a kawm khat panin a kawm khat dong dimin Baal biehinn sungah amate a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in kizepna puon kempa kungah, “Baal bie zosie adingin puon hing la in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate dingin ama in puonte a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Rechab’ tapa Jehonadab tawh Baal biehinn sungah Jehu tum hi; ama in Baal bie mite kungah, “Note lahah Topa a bie mi om loin Baal biete beh a op nadingin sui unlen en un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in kithoinate le meihal biehnate a zom suoh uhi. Tu-in Jehu in a pulamah mi sawmgiet koi a, “Na khut sung vua kang pieh khat popo a hlasuo pa in ama’ hinna a tan ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Meihal biehna pieh a man zaw behin Jehu in a cingte le uliente kungah, “Va lut unlen, va that ta un; mi khat zong pitsah sih un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n namsau tawh amate a that uhi. A cingte le uliente in amate a pulam sena’n a nei vua, Baal biehinn kulpi sung a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Baal biehinn sunga om Baal biehna song la-in a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in Baal biehna song phelkhe-in Baal biehinn a susie vua, tuni dongin ehbuh a suohsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua bangin Jehu in Israel sung panin Baal a phietmang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi vangin Bethel le Dan-a kham bawngnote a bawl zieha Israel a khielsah, Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ mawnate panin Jehu a kihei tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa in Jehu kungah, “Nang in man ka sah thu limtaha na sep zieh le ka lung lam banga Ahab’ innkuonte na bawlna ziehin khang lina dongin Israel kumpi topha tungah na tapate a to ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jehu in a lungsim zosie tawh Israel Pasien Topa’ thukham limtahin zui kha lo hi; Israel a khielsah Jeroboam’ mawna panin ama a kihei tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Topa in Israel gam pawlkhat khep ding kipan hi. Hazael in Israel gam sung zosie-ah amate a zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jordan nisuona lam, Gilead gam zosie, Gad-te, Reuben-te, Manasseh-te, Arnon Lui gei-a om Aroer panin Gilead le Bashan gam zosie a zomang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tu-in Jehu’ gamtatna a omlai teng, a sep zosie le ama thahatnate zosie, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pu a pate tawh Jehu lumton a, amate in Samaria ah ama a vui uhi. A tapa Jehoahaz in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehu in Samaria panin Israel tungah kum sawmni le giet sung uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaziah’ nu Athaliah in a tanu a si lam a thei ciengin ama in kumpi innkuon zosie tha a sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ahaziah’ sanggamnu Kumpi Joram’ tanu Jehosheba in Ahaziah’ tapa Joash man a, tha dinga kikoi kumpipa’ tapate lah pan gumang hi; tua nu in lupna khan khatah ama le a cingnu koi hi. Tua bangin ama a kitha lo nadingin Athaliah’ mu loin tua nu in ama a phuoldap hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Athaliah gam sunga a maan laitahin tua nu tawh ama kum guh sung omin Topa’ biehinn sungah a kiphuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle a kum sagina kumin siempu Jehoiada in mi sawlin Topa’ biehinn sunga a kungah Car-te’ galkap bute le kumpi inncingte a hlansah hi. Ama in amate tawh thuciemna khat bawl a, Topa’ biehinn sungah amate a kiciemsah hi. Tua ciengin ama in a kung vuah kumpipa’ tapa lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in amate thu pie a, “Na sep ding uh tami ahi hi: Sabbath ni-in nasep khawlin kumpipa’ inncing no sethum-suo-sekhat in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />(Sur’ tunkotah adang sethum-suo-sekhat om a, a cing galkapte nualam tunkot ah adang sethum-suo-sekhat a om hi) kumpi inn na cing ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuale Sabbath ni-a na sep a lut no khen nite in Topa’ biehinnpi na cing ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />na khut sung vuah na hiem ciet utawh kumpipa na kimkot ding uhi; tuale a cing galkapte lam a neh popo kithat ding hi. Kumpipa’ sungtumna le a pusuona-ah ama tawh omton un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Galkap bute in siempu Jehoiada’ thupieh tawh kizui-in a bawl uhi; sabbath ni-a nasep lut dingte tawh Sabbath ni-a nasep khawl dingte peipi cietin siempu Jehoiada kungah a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siempu pa in galkap bute tungah Topa’ biehinn sunga kumpi David’ teipite le lumte pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mi zosie in a khut sung vuah a hiem ciet uh tawi-in biehinn kimvelah kumpipa cing dingin a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in kumpipa’ tapa peipi-in a lu tungah kumpi lukhu khusah a, tuaci’n thuciemna laibu ama a pie hi; amate in ama kumpi hi, ci-in a tangko uhi; a khut uh bengin, “Kumpipa dam sawt heh,” ci-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Athlaliah in a cingte le mite’ husa a zah ciengin Topa’ biehinn sunga mite kungah ama a pei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tua nu a khuodah leh ngaina a om bangin biehna song gei-ah kumpipa dingin kumpipa gei-ah galkap bute le pengkul mutte a om vua, gammi zosie kipahin pengkul a mut uhi. Athaliah in a puon ehkehin, “Kumpi suon sawm! Kumpi suon sawm!” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu Jehoiada in galkapte a uh galkap bute thupie a, “Galkapte kikalah tua nu peipi unlen, ama’ nua a zui poma namsau tawh that un,” a ci hi. Bangzieh ahei cile siempu pa in, “ Topa’ biehinn sungah ama that sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in tua nu man uhi; kumpipa’ inn lutna Sakol Tunkot lamah ama nu pei a, tua munah ama nu kithat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate Topa’ mi ahi nadingun Jehoiada in Topa le kumpipa le mite kikalah thuciemna khat bawl hi; kumpipa le mite kikalah zong a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Baal biehinn sungah gam mi zosie pei-in a biehinn a phelmang uhi; amate in a maitamte le a milimte sukehin tua maitamte mai-ah Baal siempu Mattan a that uhi. Siempu pa in Topa’ biehinnah a cingte a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in galkap bute, Car-te, a cingte, le gam mi zosie, kaikhawm hi; tua ciengin Topa’ biehinn panin kumpipa zawpisuhin a cingte’ tunkot tawnin kumpipa’ inn a zuon uhi. Kumpite’ topha tungah ama a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n gam mi zosie a kipah uhi; tuale kumpipa’ inn ah namsau tawh Athaliah a kitha zaw langsie khuopi sung a sip dide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jehoash a maan ding a kipatin ama kum sagi a pha hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehu’ kum sagina kumin Jehoash a maan ding kipan a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmli sung maang hi. Ama nu’ min pen Zibiah ahi a, Beer-sheba mi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siempu Jehoiada in ama thu a hil ziehin Jehoash in a uh sung tungtawn Topa muna-ah a dihin a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hizongle munsangte a kipaimang tuom sih hi; mite in munsangte tungah biehpiehna le biehnate a pie lai veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoash in siempute kungah, “ Topa’ biehinn sunga kipeipi a siengtho nate’ kitatna sum zosie, milip’ pieh dinga kise sum le nop thu-a Topa’ biehinn sunga kipeipi sumte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />huna pie khat ciet tung panin siempute in la uheh; tuale biehinn puo dinga poimaw a sahna poma uh puosah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpi Jehoash’ uh kum sawmni le thumna kum dongin siempute in tua biehinn a puo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin kumpi Jehoash in siempu Jehoiada le siempu dangte hlanin a kung vuah, “Bang dinga biehinn na puo lo uh ahei? Tua ziehin tu-in huna piete tung panin sum la nawn sih unlen, biehinn puophat nadingin a sumte ap un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n siempute in mite tung panin sum la nawn loin biehinn zong puo nawn lo dingin a kithukim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu Jehoiada in singkuong khat la-in a sin vut vang a, Topa’ biehinn sung lutna zietlam pang maitam tungah koi hi; kotkhah a cing siempute in tua singkuong sungah Topa’ biehinn sunga kipeipi sum zosie a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Singkuong sungah sum tampi om ci thu a thei ciengin kumpipa’ thuvanpi pa le siempu lien pa kuonto -in Topa’ biehinn sunga om sumte simin ip tawh a tun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn nasem uhte’ khut sungah a tawitesa uh sumte a pie uhi; tua ciengin amate in Topa’ biehinn a van khutsiemte le inn lamte a guoi vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn puo nading sing lei nading, suong taw nading, le biehinn puona khat popo-a zah dingin leilesuong innlam siemte le suongkhengte tungah tuate a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa’ biehinn adingin ngun kuongte, taitete, kuongkumte, pengkulte, ahi sihle kham hile, ngun vanzah khat popo hile, Topa’ biehinn sunga kipeipi sumte panin kibawl lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa’ biehinn a puo nasemte tungah tua sumte kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate a dihtat seng ziehin nasemte kunga a piehsawn ding vua a khut sung vua ki-ap sumte tung panin amate in sum zahna sazien a ngen sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in Topa’ inn ah khielna zieha biehna sumte le mawna zieha biehna sumte a peipi sih uhi; tuate pen siempute-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khum hunlai-in Aram kumpipa Hazael kuonto a, Gath simin a la hi. Ahi vangin Hazael in Jerusalem do dinga peito dingin a mai a ngat leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah Kumpi Jehoash in Jehoshaphat, Jehoram, le Ahaziah, ama’ pu le pate, le Judah kumpite in a apsa pieh dinga a kamciem uh letsong zosie le a kamciemsa letsongte le Topa’ inn sung le kumpipa gou kholna sunga a kimu kham zosie la-in Aram kumpipa Hazael kungah a puoh hi. Tua ciengin Jerusalem panin Hazael a peikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu-in Joash’ gamtatna a omlai teng le a sep zosie, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nasemte dingkhie-in sawmdapna khat a gel vua, Silla zotsuhna lampi Millo inn sungah Joash a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama a si nadinga a satlia pa khu a nasempa Shimeath’ tapa Jozacar le Shomer’ tapa Jehozabad ahi uhi. Amate in David’ khuopi sungah a pu a pate tawh ama a vui uhi; tua ciengin a tapa Amaziah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpi Ahaziah’ tapa Joash a kum sawmni le thumna kumin Jehu’ tapa Jehoahaz in Samaria panin Israel ah maan kipan a, kum sawm le sagi sung a maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa’ mitmu-in ama siet gamtat a, Israel a khielsah Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ mawnate a zui hi; tuate panin ama kihem lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel tungah Topa’ lungthahna kikuontaw a, tuaci’n ama in Aram kumpipa Hazael’ khut sungah amate pie den mielmuol a, tua ciengin Hazael’ tapa Benhadad’ khut sungah zong a pie den mielmuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jehoahaz in Topa kungah thum a, Topa in ama’ thumnate a ngai hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Aram kumpipa in Israel a kibawlsietna le Aram kumpipa in amate a bangci bawlsiet ahei ci ama in mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Aram-te’ khut sung panin a suotah thei nadingun Topa in Israel tungah hundampa khat a pie hi. Nidang lai bangin a inn vuah Israel mite a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel a khielsah Jeroboam innkuon’ mawnate panin a kihem sih vua, tuate a zui zawsop uhi; khuom siengtho zong Samaria ah a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Aram kumpipa in amate a susie a, ama in amate vutvai a suosah tah ziehin Jehoahaz kungah sakol galkap sawmnga sanga a tamzaw lo, sakol leeng sawm le lei galkap tul sawm bang beh a om tabo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-in Jehoahaz’ gamtatna a omlai teng, a sep zosie le a vangliatna, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pu a pate tawh Jehoahaz lumton a, Samaria ah ama a vui uhi; tua ciengin a tapa Joash in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Joash a kum sawmthum le sagina kumin Jehoahaz’ tapa Jehoash in Samaria panin Israel ah maan ding a kipan hi; ama kum sawm le guh sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa muna-ah ama a siet gamtat a, Israel a mawsah Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ mawna zosie panin a kihem sih hi; ama in tuate a zui zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in Jehoash’ gamtatna a omlai teng, ama sep zosie le Judah kumpipa Amaziah a dona a thahatnate, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pu a pate tawh Joash lumton a, ama’ kumpi topha tungah Jeroboam a to hi; Israel kumpite tawh Samaria ah Joash kivuiton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu-in Elisha in a si nading natna a vei ciengin ama kungah Israel kumpi Joash hawsuhin a mai-ah kap a, “Ka pa, ka pa! Israel sakol leengte le a sakol tunga tuongte!” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elisha in ama kungah, “Thal khat le thaltangte hing la vawi,” a ci hi; tuaci’n ama in thal khat le a tangte a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Israel kumpipa kungah, “Thalpi kuoi in,” a ci hi; tuale ama in a kuoi hi. Elisha in kumpipa’ khut tungah a khut a ngam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Na tawlet nisuona lamah hong vawi,” a ci hi’ tuale ama in a hong hi. Elisha in, “Na thal kap in,” a ci hi’ tuale ama in a kap hi. Tua ciengin ama in, “ Topa’ guolzawna thaltang, Aram-te tunga guolzawna thaltang! Bangzieh ahei cile amate na tha sieng masangin Aphek ah Aram-te na do ding hi,” a ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “Thaltangte lakia in,” ci hi; tuale ama in a lakia hi. Ama in Israel kumpipa kungah, “Tuate tawh lei lah sat in,” a ci hi; ama in thumvei satin a khawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama tungah Pasien’ mipa lungthah a, “Ngavei ahiei, guhvei ahiei khat na sat ding a kilawm ahi hi; tua hile amate na tha masangin Aram-te na satlia ding a, ahi vangin tu-in thumvei maimai na sat ding ahi ta bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n Elisha si a, amate in ama a vui uhi. Tu-in Moab mihonte in khumi kum khal hun sungin tua gam a sim zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi khat a kivui laitahin misuomte honkhat kimu a, Elisha’ hankhuh-ah siluong a pai uhi; tua mipa in Elisha’ gute a tham lien leh ama hingkia-in a keng tawh a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu-in Aram kumpipa Hazael in Jehoahaz’ uh sung tungtawnin Israel a bawlsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanle Topa in amate khuotuo-in lainatna nei hi; Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob tawh a thuciemna ziehin amate lamah kinga hi; ama in amate susie loin tu dongin ama’ mai panin amate a notmang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aram kumpipa Hazael a si ciengin a tapa Ben-hadad in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pa Jehoahaz’ tung panin gal sungah Hazael in a lahsa khuopite Hazael’ tapa Ben-hadad tung panin Jehoahaz’ tapa Jehoash in lakia hi. Jehoash in Ben-hadad thumvei zo a, ama in Israel khuopite ngakia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jehoahaz’ tapa Jehoash a kum nina kumin, Judah kumpi, Joash’ tapa Amaziah maan ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le nga pha a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmni le kuo sung maang hi. A nu’ min Jehoaddin hi a, Jerusalem-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa muna-ah a dihin ama gamta a, hinanle a pu David bang zo lo hi; ama in a pa Joash’ bawlsa zosie a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin munsangte a kihemkhie tuom sih hi; munsangte-ah mite kithoi-in biehnate a pie veve lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama’ khut sungah kumpi thuneina dettahin a nei behin a pa kumpipa a that a nasemte ama in that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in a thupieh Moses thukham laibu sungah, “Tate’ ziehin pate kithat lo ding a, pate’ ziehin tate kithat lo ding hi; ahi vangin mi zosie amau’ mawna ziehin a si ding uhi,” ci-a a kigiel dung zui-in ama in mi thatte’ tate that lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Ci Kuom-ah Edom-te tul sawm thatin, Sela busimin a la hi; ama in a min dingin Jokthe-el phuo a, tuni dongin tua min kip peisuoh lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Amaziah in Israel kumpi, Jehu’ tapa Jehoahaz, a tapa Kumpipa Jehoash kungah kamtaite sawl a, “Hing pei inlen khatlekhat kimaituo-in kitalsih vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jehoash in Judah kumpi Amaziah kungah kam vaihlahin, “Lebanon-a om thangling kung khat in Lebanon-a om taamtah kung khat kungah mi sawin, ‘’A zi dingin ka tapa tungah na tanu pie in,’ ci hi; ahi vangin ama gamsa khat a vasuoh ta a, tua thangling a tuoncil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangma in Edom-te na zo tahpi a, tua in na lungsim a liensah gawp hi. Na minthanna tawh lungkim lel inlen inn ah om khinkhian in; bang dinga nangma le Judah’ pua nadingin buoina bawl ding na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Amaziah in a thu ngai lo hi. Tuaci’n Israel kumpipa Jehoash a kuonto hi; Judah-a’ ahi Beth-shemesh gal kidona sungah ama le Judah Kumpipa Amaziah khatlekhat kimaituo-in a kisi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel in Judah zo hi; mi zosie a inn ciet vuah a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jehoash in Beth-shemesh ah Ahaziah’ tapa Joash, a tapa Judah kumpipa Amaziah man hi; ama in Jerusalem lam zuon a, Ephraim tunkot panin Innning Tunkot dong, Jerusalem kulpi tong zali sung satcim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in kumpipa’ inn sung goukholna sunga a om kham le ngun zosie le Topa’ biehinn sunga a kimu umlebeel zosie tomgamin, a mite zong a man hi; tua ciengin Samaria ah ama a peikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in Jehoash nasep le a gamtatna a omlai teng, a vanglietna le Judah Kumpipa Amaziah tawh a kidona, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Jehoash lumton a, Israel kumpite tawh Samaria ah kivui hi; tua ciengin a tapa Jeroboam in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel kumpipa, Jehoahaz’ tapa Jehoash a si zaw ciengin Judah kumpipa, Joash’ tapa Amaziah kum sawm le nga sung hing lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in Amaziah’ nasepna a omlai teng, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in Jerusalem-ah ama a sawmdap vua, ama Lachish ah a taimang hi. Ahi vangin Lachish ah a nuadel ding mi sawlin tua tahah ama a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in sakol tawh ama a puo uhi; David’ khuopi Jerusalem ah a pu a pate tawh ama kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah mi zosie in kum sawm le guh a pha Uzziah a la vua, a pa Amaziah’ za a luo dingin kumpi-in ama a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Kumpi Amaziah a lupton zaw ciengin Elath lampha kia-in Judah ngasah kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Joash’ tapa Amaziah a kum sawm le ngana kumin, Israel kumpipa, Jehoash’ tapa Jeroboam Samaria ah maan ding kipan a, ama kum sawmli le khat sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa muna-ah ama siet gamtat hi; Israel a mawsah Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ mawnate panin ama a kihem tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in Gath-hepher pana kamsangpa Amittai’ tapa, ama’ nasem Jonah tungtawnin Topa Israel Pasien thugenna tawh kizui-in Israel gamgite, Lebo-hamath panin Arabah Tuipi dong ngakia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Israel’ thuohna nasie mama hi, ci-in Topa in mu hi; sal hile, sal lo hile a suohta koima om lo a, Israel panpi ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanle vannei leitungah Topa in Israel’ min phietmang ding thu genkha lo a, tuaci’n ama in Jehoash’ tapa Jeroboam khut tawh amate hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu-in Jeroboam’ gamtatna a omlai teng, a sepsa zosie, a vanglietna, a galsimna le Judah in a na nei ngai Damascus le Hamath khuopite Israel dinga a ngakiana, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A pu a pate ahi Israel kumpite tawh Jeroboam lumton hi; a tapa Zechariah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kumpi Jeroboam a kum sawmni le sagina kumin Judah kumpipa Amaziah’ tapa Azariah maan ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama a maan ding a kipatin kum sawm le guh pha a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmnga le ni sung maang hi. A nu’ min Jecoliah ahi a, Jerusalem-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa Amaziah’ bawl bang lienin Topa muna-ah a manin a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin munsangte a kihemkhie tuon sih hi; munsangte tungah mite kithoi-in biehna pie lai veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in a si dongin phah natna tawh kumpipa a gawt ziehin inn tuomah a teng hi. Kumpipa’ tapa Jotham in kumpi inn sung thu zosie van a, tua gam mite uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in Azariah’ gamtatna a omlai teng le a sep zosie, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A a pu a pate tawh Azariah lumton hi; amate in David’ khuopi sunga a pu a pate tawh ama a vui uhi; a tapa Jotham in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah Kumpi Azariah a kum sawmthum le gietna kumin Samaria ah Jeroboam’ tapa Zechariah hla guh sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pu a pate na bawlsa bangin Topa muna-ah ama siet gamtat hi. Israel a mawsah Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam mawnate panin ama a kikoicing sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jabesh’ tapa Shallum in ama a sawmdap a, tuale mipite mai-ah ama satpua-in that hi, tuale ama tangin a maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in Zechariah’ sepna a omlai teng, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam pen Jehu’ kunga a na gen, “Khang lina dongin na tapate kumpi topha tungah to ding uhi,” a ci Topa’ thuciemna ahi hi. Tua bang ma-in a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah kumpi Uzziah a kum sawmthum le kuona kumin Jabesh’ tapa Shallum maan ding kipan a, ama Samaria ah hla khat sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Tirzih panin Samaria ah Gadi’ tapa Menahem tungto hi; ama in Jabesh’ tapa Shallum satlia-in that hi; ama tangin ama maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in Shallum’ sepna a omlai teng le ama in a sepsa a mi sawmdapna, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in khum hunin ama adingin a kotpite uh a hon lo ziehun Menahem in Tiphsah le a sunga om zosie le Tirzah panin a gam sung teng a bulu hi. Ama in gam sunga numei naupai zosie’ gil a kuikehpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah kumpi Azariah a kum sawmthum le kum kuona kumin Gadi’ tapa Menahem in Israel tungah maan ding kipan a, Samaria ah kum sawm sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa muna-ah ama siet gamtat hi; a hin sung tungtawnin Israel a mawsah Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ mawnate panin ama kikoicing lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khum gam a sim dingin Assyria kumpi Pul kuonto hi; a kumpi aana a tuhkip thei nadinga a panpi dingin Menahem in Pul tungah ngun talent tulkhat a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Menahem in Assyria kumpipa tunga a pieh dingin mihau zosie, mi khat ciengin ngun shekel sawmnga ta, Israel tung panin a dong hi. Tuaci’n Assyria kumpipa kilekia-in gam sungah gieh nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-in Menahem’ sepna a omlai teng le a septe zosie, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Menahem lumton a, a tapa Pekahiah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah kumpi Azariah a kum sawmngana kumin Menahem’ tapa Pekahiah in Samaria panin Israel tungah maan ding kipan hi. Ama kum ni sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa muna-ah ama siet gamtat hi; Israel a mawsah Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ mawnate panin ama kikoicing lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A galkap bupa Remaliah’ tapa Pekah in Gilead-te mihing sawmnga tawh ama sawmdap a, Samaria-a kumpipa’ inn kulpi sungah ama le Argob le Arieh-te tawh suomtha hi; tuale ama thatin ama tangin maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu-in Pekahiah’ nasepna a omlai teng le a sep zosie, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judah kumpi Azariah a kum sawmnga le nina kumin Remaliah’ tapa Pekah in Samaria panin Israel tungah maan ding kipan a, ama kum sawmni sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa muna-ah ama siet gamtat hi; Israel a mawsah Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ mawnate panin ama kikoicing lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel kumpi Pekah hun sungin Assyria kumpi Tiglath-pileser kuonin Ijon, Abel-beth-maacah, Janoah, Kedesh, Hazor, Gilead, le Galilee, le Naphtali gam zosie a la hi; tuale Assyria ah salin a mite kai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Elah’ tapa Hoshea in Remaliah’ tapa Pekah sawmdapin ama busimin a that hi. Ama in Uzziah’ tapa Jotham a kum sawm nina kumin ama tangin maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tu-in Pekah’ gamtatna a omlai teng le a sep zosie, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel kumpi Remaliah’ tapa kumpi Pekah a kum nina kumin Judah kumpi Uzziah’ tapa Jotham in uh ding kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in uh ding a kipatin kum sawm le nga pha a, kum sawm le guh sung Jerusalem ah uh hi. A nu’ min Jerusha ahi a, Zadok’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A pa Uzziah’ gamtat bang lienin Topa muna-ah ama a dihin a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanle munsangte a kihemkhie tuon sih hi; munsangte tungah mite kithoi-in biehna pie lai veve uhi. Ama in Topa’ biehinn kotkhah tungnung pen a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tu-in Jotham’ nasepna a omlai teng le a sep zosie, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua hun lai-in Topa in Judah sim dingin Aram kumpipa Rezin le Remaliah’ tapa Pekah sawl ding kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Jotham lumton a, David’ khuopi sungah kivui hi; a tapa Ahaz in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Remaliah’ tapa Pekah a kum sawm le sagina kumin Juda kumpi Jotham’ tapa Ahaz maan ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kumpi sep kipatin Ahaz kum sawmni pha a, ama kum sawm le guh sung Jerusalem ah maang hi. A pu David’ gamtatsa bangin a Pasien Topa muna-ah a dihin gamta lo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel kumpite’ lampi ma zuizaw hi. Topa in Israel mite mai-ah a na delgamsa ahi minamte na zah a huothuoi tawndante ama in zui-in a tapa nangawn kithoina-in mei tawh a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in muoltunga munsangte tung le sing hlim nei teng tungah kithoina bawlin biehnate pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jerusalem sim dingin Aram kumpi Rezin le Israel kumpi Remaliah’ tapa Pekah kuonto hi; amate in Ahaz a kui-im vua, ahi vangin a zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Edom kumpipa in Edom adingin Elath lakia a, tuale Elath panin Judea-te a notmang hi; tuale tuni donga a tenna uh Elath ah Edom-te a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahaz in Assyria kumpi Tiglath-pileser kungah kamtaite sawl a, “Keima na tapa le na nasempa ka hi hi. Hing kuonto inlen, keima ei sim Aram kumpipa le Israel kumpipa’ khut sung panin ei hunkhie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahaz in Topa’ inn sung le kumpipa’ goukholna sunga a kimu ngun le khamte la a, Assyria kumpipa kungah letsongin a hlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Assyria kumpipa in ama’ thugen a ngai hi; Damascus sim dingin Assyria kumpipa kuonto-in tua khuo la-in Kir-ah a mite galmatin a puo hi; tua ciengin ama in Rezin that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Assyria kumpi Tiglath-pileser tawh kimu dingin Damascus-ah kumpi Ahaz a haw ciengin Damacus-a om maitam a mu hi. Kumpi Ahaz in siempu Uriah kungah maitam lim, a kibawl dan a neng a tawnga a kibahpi khat a hlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siempu Uriah in maitam a bawl hi; Damascus panin Kumpi Ahaz in a hlah bang dan tawh kizui-in Kumpi Ahaz a tun masangin Damascus panin siempu Uriah in maitam na bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Damascus panin kumpipa a tun ciengin kumpipa in tua maitam a vel a, tua ciengin kumpipa in maitam lam nehin a tungah a kato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in a meihal biehna le an tawh biehna pie-in, ama in a dawn thei biehnate sung a, maitam tungah thunuom biehna sisan a the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in a maitam le Topa’ biehinn kikal panin Topa mai-a om sumngo maitam a ladawh a, tua pen leilu lama om ama’ maitam tungah a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpi Ahaz in siempu Uriah thupie a, “Gam sung mi zosie’ meihal biehna, an tawh biehna le a dawn thei biehna utawh maitam thupi pen tungah zingmawng meihal biehna, nitah an tawh biehna, kumpipa’ meihal biehna le a an tawh biehnate halton in; tua ciengin maitam tungah meihal biehna sisan zosie le biehpiehna sisan zosie the in; ahi vangin sumngo maitam pen keima’ thudawhna ding hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siempu Uriah in kumpi Ahaz’ thupieh zosie a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Ahaz in a ki-ngahna singte sattan a, tuale ama in tuate panin khutsilna kuong hemdawh hi; ama in a nei-a sumngo bawngtangte tung panin tui kuongpi hemdawh a, suongciel tungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn panin ama in kumpi inn sunga sabbath ni-a kumpipa zah dinga kibawl tungkhu a nei lampi le kumpipa lutna lampi pulam a hemdawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahaz nasep a omlai teng, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Ahaz lumton a, David’ khuopi sungah a pu a pate tawh kivui hi. A tapa Hezekiah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpi Ahaz’ a kum sawm le nina kumin Elah’ tapa Hoshea in Samaria panin Israel tungah maan ding a kipan a, ama kum kuo sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa muna-ah ama siet gamtat a, hinanle ama mai-a Israel kumpite bang lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama sim dingin Assyria kumpipa Shalmaneser kuonto hi; Hoshea pen a khut nei mi suohin ama sieh le kaih a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin Assyria kumpipa in Hoshea’ lebawlna mu hi; azieh pen ama in Egypt kumpi So kungah kamtaite sawlin kumsiela a pieh bangin sieh le kaihte a pie nawn sih hi. Tua ahi ziehin Assyria kumpipa in ama manin thong sungah a khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Assyria kumpipa in gam sung zosie simin Samaria dong ban hi; kum thum sung tua khuopi a kui-im hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hoshea a kum kuona kumin Assyria kumpipa in Samaria la hi; ama in Israel-te, Assyria ah a peipi hi. Ama in Halah gam sung, Habor gam, Gozan gun le Medes khuopite sungah amate a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami thu a pienna pen Egypt kumpi Pharaoh’ khut nei Egypt gam panin amate a peipi Topa a Pasien uh tungah Israel mite a maw zieh uh ahi hi. Amate in pasien dangte a bie vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Israel mite mai-a a delmang minamte’ ngaina le Israel kumpite in a na pat ngainate a zui zieh uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel mite in a Topa a Pasien uh’ lang khatah a man lo thute a dapbawl uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amate in muolsang zosie le a na dawng sing hlim nei zosie-ah amate dingin songte le khuom siengthote a phut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum mun amate mai-a Topa in a na nawmang minamte’ bawl bangin amate in munsang zosie-ah biehnate a lui uhi. Amate in a hoi lo nate semin Topa lungthahsah uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in amate kungah, “Note in tamte haw’ na na sem sih ding uhi,” a ci milimte’ na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hizongle Topa in kamsang zosie le thumu zosie tungtawnin Israel le Judah hilkhol a, “Na pu na pate uh ka thupiehsa thukhamte le ka nasem kamsangte tung tawna na kung vua thu kang puoh tawh kituohin na tatsietnate uh panin kihei-in ka thupiehnate le ka thukhamte zui un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a thu ngai loin, Topa a Pasien uh a um lo a pu a pate ma bangin a lungkhauh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in ama’ thukhamte le a pu a pate tawh a bawlsa a thuciemna le amate tunga a pieh hilkholnate a thusim sih uhi. Amate in milim zuoute nuazui-in mizuou a suoh uhi; amate bangin gamta sih un ci-in Topa in a thupieh tawh kisai-in, amate in a kim a pam vua om minamte a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in Topa a Pasien uh’ thupieh zosie nuolin amate dingin bawngno lim ni a kheng vua, khuom siengtho khat a bawl uhi; amate in vantunga na om zosie bie-in Baal’ na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in a tanute le a tapate kithoina-in mei ah a hal uhi; amate in aisanna le khutlam etnate a zang uhi; tuale Topa muna-ah amate siet gamtat ding kiphalin ama a lungthahsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel tungah Topa lungthahin ama in ama’ muna panin amate a hemkhie hi; Judah minam khat beh ci simlo, koima dang om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah in Topa a Pasien uh’ thupiehnate zui loin Israel in a na bawltawm ngainate a zuipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in Israel’ suonlehlahte zosie a nuol hi; ama in amate dan pie a, ama kung panin a hawlkhiet masangin mi bulute’ khut sungah amate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in David innkuon panin Israel a khenkhiet zaw ciengin amate in Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam kumpi-in a koi uhi. Jeroboam in Topa a zuina panin Israel notmangin mawna lienpi a bawlsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jeroboam in a na bawlsa mawna zosie Israel mite in a bawl uhi; a nasem kamsangte tungtawnin a genkholsa bangin a mu lona munah Topa in Israel a hepkhiet dongin tuate panin amate a kikoicing sih uhi. Tuaci’n tuni dongin a gam panun Assyria-ah salin Israel a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Assyria kumpipa in Babylon, Cuthah, Avva, Hamath, le Sepharvaim panin mite peipi-in Israel mite tangin Samaria khuopite-ah amate a koi hi; amate in Samaria gam luo-in a khuopite-ah amate a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua muna a ten cilun amate in Topa bie lo uhi. Tua ahi ziehin Topa in amate a that humpite amate lahah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n Assyria kumpipa kungah, “Nangma in puohin Samaria khuopite-a na koi minamte in khum gamte pasien’ thukham a thei sih uhi; tua ahi ziehin ama in humpite a lah vuah a sawl hi. Amate in tua gamte pasien’ thukham a thei lo ziehun humpite in amate that hi,” ci’n kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin Assyria kumpipa in thu pie a, “Khum sungah tua gam pana nang peipi uh siempute lahah khat puoh un; khum munah ama pei-in tengsah unlen, a gam sung pasien’ thukhamte amate hilsah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n Samaria pana a puoh uh siempute khat pei-in Bethel ah teng hi; ama in Topa bangci bieh ding ci thu amate kungah a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi vangin minam zosie in a pasien ciet uh a kibawl vua, minam zosie in amau’ tenna khuopi sungah Samaria mite’ bawlsa munsangte-a biehbuhnote sungah tuate a koi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babylon mite in Succoth-benoth pasien, Cuth mite in Nergal pasien, Hamath mite in Ashima pasien;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Avva mite in Nibhaz le Tartak pasiente a bawl uhi; Sepharvaim-te in Sephavaim pasien-te ahi, Adrammelech le Anammelech biehna-in mei-ah a tate a haltum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate in Topa zong a bie vua, munsangte-a biehna siempu sem dingin a sung panun mi namkim se-in tuate in munsangte-a biehbuhnote-ah amate dingin biehpiehna a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Topa a bie vua, a kipuohna gam mite’ tawndan zui-in a pasien-te uh’ na zong a semton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate in tuni dongin nidanga a zah uh amau’ ngainate a zomsuoh lai uhi. Amate in Topa bie loin Topa in Israel ci-in a minvaw Jacob tate tunga a thupiehsa thukhamte, ngaina kipte, zui ding ngainate, le a thupiehte a zui sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa in amate tawh thuciemna khat bawl zo a, amate thupie in, “Note in pasien dangte bie loin, a mai vuah zong kun loin amau’ na zong na sem sih ding vua, amate kungah na kithoi sih ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />ahi vangin Egypt gam panin a lien mama vanglietna le a kizah a banhat tawh note ang peipi Topa na bie zaw ding uhi, a mai-ah noma ma kunin ama tungah na kithoi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in note dinga a giel thukhamte, ngaina kipte, zui ding ngainate le thupiehnate zui dingin na ngaisun zing ding uhi. Note in pasien dangte na bie sih ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />note tawh ka bawlsa thuciemna na mangngil sih ding uhi. Note in pasien dangte na bie sih ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh na bie zaw ding uhi; ama in na gal zosie’ khut sung panin note ang hunkhie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanle amate in ngai loin nidanga a ngaina lui a zangsuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuaci’n tam minamte in Topa a bie vua, ahi vangin amau’ khentawm ahi milimte’ na zong a sem uhi; tuni dongin a pu a pate uh gamtat bangin a tate ule a tute uh a gamta lai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kumpi, Elah’ tapa Hoshea a kum thumna kumin Judah kumpi, Ahaz’ tapa Hezekiah maan ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama a maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le nga pha a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmni le kuo sung maang hi. A nu’ min Abi ahi a, Zechariah’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pu David bangin Topa muna-ah ama a manin gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in munsangte hemkhie-in biehna songte susie a, khuom siengtho a phuamang hi. Tua hun dongin Israel mite in tua tungah biehnate a pieh ziehun ama in Moses’ na bawlsa sumngo gulpi satguoi hi; tua pen Neshutan kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Israel Pasien, Topa muong hi; tuaci’n ama’ nua-a Judah kumpite zosie lahah hile ama mai-ate lahah hile ama bang koima khat beh om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in Topa a tudet hi; ama’ nua a zuina panin ama kihem ngai loin Topa in Moses kunga a gen thupiehnate a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama tawh Topa a om hi; a peina popo-ah ama lawcing hi. Ama in Assyria kumpipa ledo a, ama’ na a sem sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in galvilna tausang panin kulpi nei khuopi dong, le Gaza le a gam sung cieng dongin Philistia-te a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel kumpi, Elah’ tapa Hoshea a kum sagina kum ahi, kumpi Hezekiah a kum lina kumin Samaria sim dingin Assyria Kumpipa Shalmaneser kuonto-in imtawm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kum thum a cin ciengin Samaria kila hi. Israel kumpi Hoshea’ kum kuona kum ahi, Hezekiah’ kum guhna kumin Samaria kila hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Assyria kumpipa in Assyria ah Israel-te puoh a, Halah gam sung, Habor gam, Gozan lui le Media khuopite sungah amate a tengsah hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile amate in Topa a Pasien uh’ thu mang loin, a thuciemna ahi Topa’ nasem Moses’ thupieh zosie palsat uhi; amate in thu ngai loin, thu zong a mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpi Hezekiah a kum sawm le lina kumin kulpi a nei Judah khuopite zosie a sim dingin Assyria kumpipa Sennacherib kuonto-in tua khuo teng a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah kumpi Hezekiah in Lachish-a Assyria kumpi kungah mi sawl a, “Ka gamta khiel ta hi; ka kung panin nuakia ta’n; nei nget popo kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi. Assyria kumpipa in Judah kumpipa Hezekiah kungah ngun talent zathum le kham talent sawmthum ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekiah in Topa’ biehinn sung le kumpipa’ goukholna-a om ngun zosie ama a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hunin Hezekiah in Topa’ biehinn kotte tung pan le Judah kumpipa Hezekiah in innkhuom tunga a zut khamte khawhin Assyria kumpipa tungah tua teng a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Assyria kumpipa in Tartan-te, Rabsaris mite le Rabshakeh-te, galkap hon tampi tawh Lachish panin Jerusalem-a Kumpi Hezekiah kungah a sawl hi. Amate kuonto-in Jerusalem a tung uhi. Amate a tun ciengun amate pei-in Puonsawppa’ Lo zotna lampi-a om buol tungnung tuilahna gei-ah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa a hlat ciengun amate kungah kumpi inn uhpa Hilkiah’ tapa Eliakim, thuvanpi pa Shebna le thuciemte Asaph’ tapa Joah-te a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rabshakeh in amate kungah, “Hezekiah kungah gen un: Kumpi thupi, Assyria kumpipa in tam bangin gen hi: Tam banga na kimuonna uh bang pen suong na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note in thu kigen maimai haw po galdo nadinga galsiemna le thahatna-in ngaisun na hi uh amah? Kei nei ledo nadingun a koi pen suong na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-in note in a tunga a kingam poma’ khut a sun ding pumpeng kikuoitan kung khat tawh a kibang lel Egypt na suong uhi. Ama a suong mi zosie tungah Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh pen tua bang lel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in keima kungah, ‘ Topa ka Pasien ka suong uhi,’ na ci uleh Hezekiah in a munsangte le a maitamte hepkhiet piehin Judah le Jerusalem kungah, “Jerusalem-a tami maitam mai-ah na bie ding uhi,” a ci pa pen ama hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu-in hing pei un, ka pupa ahi Assyria kumpipa tawh kikhapna khat bawl un. No lam panin a tunga tuong ding mi na nga zo ding uleh sakol tulni kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Egypt-te’ leengte le sakol tungtuongte muong na hi uleh ka pu’ nasemte lahah a neupen galkap bu khat zong bangci nan zo ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua tham loin, Topa tawh loin tam mun simin a susie dinga ang kuonto ka hi amah? Topa in keima kungah, “Tami gam sim dingin kuonto inlen susie in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hilkiah’ tapa Eliakim, Shebnah, le Joah in Rabshakeh kungah, “Kang thum uhi, kote in Aram ham thei ka hi ziehun na nasemte Aram hamin ei hopi in. Kulpi tunga mite zahin Jew hamin ei hopi sin,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin Rabshakeh in a kung vuah, “Ka pupa in na pupa uh kung le no kung beha tami thugen dingin ei sawl a, amau’ eh ma ne-in amau’ zun ma a dawn, note tawh siton dinga kul tunga omte kungah zong ei sawl tuom sih amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin Rabshakeh dingto-in a Jew hamin a gingin kiko a, “Kumpi lien, Assyria kumpipa’ thu za un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Hezekiah kisolsah sih un, azieh pen ama in ka khut sung panin note ang hunkhie zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa in eite ei hunkhie tahtah ding a, Assyria kumpipa’ khut sungah tami khuopi kipie lo ding hi, ci-a Hezekiah’ ang genna tawh Topa suong luo sih un,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hezekiah’ thu ngai sih un. Bangzieh ahei cile Assyria kumpipa in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Keima kungah hing pei-in keima tawh noma’ leitang tawh kibang mun le gam, an le lengga pienna, moh le lengga um opna, olive thau le khuoizu pienna gamah si loin na hin zawh thei nading uh gamah kang tut masangin a koima po in noma’ lengga ciet kinehin noma’ theiga ciet ne a, noma’ tuinah ciet pan tui na kidawn ding uhi. Ama in na kung vuah, “ Topa in note ang hunkhie ding hi,” ci-in Hezekiah in ang lekai ciengin a thu na mang sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Minamte’ pasien khatpo in Assyria kumpipa’ khut sung panin a gam hunkhie zo ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hamath le Arpad’ pasien-te heita uh ahei? Shepharvaim, Hena, le Ivvah’ pasien-te lah? Amate in ka khut sung panin Samaria a hunkhie zo ngel vuoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa in ka khut sung panin Jerusalem a hutkhiet nadingin gam zosie-a pasien-te lahah a koi pen in ka khut sung panin a gam uh hunkhie zo ngai ahei?’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa in, “Koima in dawng sih un,” ci-in thu a pieh ziehin mite sip dide-in kam khat beh a dawngkia sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpi inn uhpa, Hilkiah’ tapa Eliakim, thuvanpi pa Shebnah, le thuciemte pa Asaph’ tapa Joah-te a puon uh ehkehsa-in Hezekiah kungah a pei vua, Rabshakeh’ thu gen teng ama kungah a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Hezekiah in tam thu a zah ciengin a puonte ehmalin la-ip puon sil a, Topa’ biehinn sungah ama a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in kumpi innsung uhpa Eliakim, thuvanpi pa Shebna, le khangham siempute la-ip puon silsahin Amoz’ tapa kamsang Isaiah kungah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Hezekiah in tam bangin gen hi: Tuni pen lungkham ni, ei kiphawsiet ni, mindai ni ahi hi; nausente a suo hun tung a, suo zawh nading tha a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pupa ahi Assyria kumpipa in a hing zing Pasien simmaw dinga a sawl Rabshakeh’ thugen zosie Topa na Pasien in za-in, Topa na Pasien in a zahsa thute niel zo ta kha ding hi; tua ahi ziehin a omlai teng adingin thu ngetpieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpi Hezekiah’ nasemte Isaiah kung a tun ciengun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isaiah in amate kungah, “Na pupa uh kungah tam bangin gen un. Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Assyria kumpipa’ nasemte in keima ei gensietna, na zahsa uh thute ziehin zau sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in kam baleng khat za-in a gamah a kilekia nadingin ama sungah hlagau khat ka koi ding hi; keima in ama’ gam ma-ah namsau tawh ka sisah ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa in Lachish nuasie zo lam a zah ziehin Rabshakeh kilekia a, Assyria kumpipa in Libnah a simlam a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa in Ethiopia Kumpi Tirhakah tungtang thu a zah ciengin, “En in, nang ang sim dingin ama kuon zo hi,” a ci ciengin ama in Hezekiah kungah kamtaite sawlkia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Judah kumpipa Hezekiah kungah tam bangin na gen ding uhi: Assyria kumpipa khut sungah Jerusalem kipie lo ding hi, ci-a ang kamciem na muon na suon uh ahi na Pasien un kisolsah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En in, Assyria kumpite in gam zosie tunga a bawlnasa, tuate a suhsietna dan nangma in na zahsa ahi hi. Nangma ang kihunkhie zo diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate in a na suhsietsa minamte, Gozan, Haran, Rezeph, le Telassar gama Eden mite, tua minamte’ pasien-te in amate a hunkhie zo ta uh amah ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath kumpipa, Arpad kumpipa, Sepharvaim khuopi kumpipa, Hena kumpipa, ahi sihle Ivvah kumpipa hei sunga om uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hezekiah in kamsangte tung panin laih kihlah nga-in a sim hi; tua ciengin Topa’ biehinnah Hezekiah kato-in Topa mai-ah tua laihlah a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekiah in Topa mai-ah thu ngen a, “Cherub-te tunga a to Topa Israel Pasien aw, leitung kumpi gam zosie sung panin nangma, nangma beh Pasien na hi hi; nangma in leitung le vantung na bawlsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa aw, na bil daw inlen, ka thugen ei za in. Topa aw, na mit hah inlen ei en in; Sennacherib in hingzing Pasien a zako nadinga ang hlah a thugente za in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tahtahin, Topa aw, Assyria kumpite in minamte le a gam uh susie-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />meikhuh sungah a pasien-te uh a paipieh uhi. Tuate pasien hi loin mihing khut tawh a kibawl singlesuong ahi bo ziehin amate kisusie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n tu-in Topa kohaw’ Pasien aw, leitung kumpi gam zosie in nang, nang beh Pasien na hi lamtah a thei nadingun ama’ khut sung panin kote ei hunkhie in, kang thum hi, Topa aw,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Amoz’ tapa Isaiah in Hezekiah kungah mi sawl a, “Israel Pasien Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Assyria kumpipa Sennacherib tungtang ka kunga na thungetna keima in ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama tawh kisai-in Topa’ gensa thu tam bang ahi hi: ‘Zion tanu, ngahnu siengtho in nang ang simmaw a, ang thupise sih hi. Jerusalem tanu in na nuasang-ah a lu ang peisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Koi pen zako a, koi pen gensie na hei? Koi na langpanna tawh na aw sangsahin, kilietsahna tawh mit leh vapial na hei? Israel’ a Siengtho Pa, a langpan na hi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na kamtaite tungtawnin Topa na zako zo hi. “Ka sakol leeng tampite tawh muolsang dawnah ka kato zo a, Lebanon cieng dong ka tung zo hi; a taamtah sing sangpente le a taapi sing hoipente ka phuomang ta hi. A gamla pen khawlmun le a gammang pen lahah keima ka lut zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima in tuikhuhte to-in, gamdang tuite ka dawn a, ka ketaw tawh Egypt lui zosie ka gawtasah hi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />‘Sawtlai panin ka na gelsa ahi lam za kha lo na mah? Tanglai peh panin lai-a ka gelsa ahi a, tu-a ka tunsah ding thute kulnei khuopite nin bulom bangin na guoicimsah nading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />amau’ sunga tengte a hatna uh kiemin, amate zausi-in a amkham gawp vua; gamlah singno dawngte le lopa ngehte bang le innkhum tunga lopate bangin a op laitah, a khangliet masangun a gawta dinga ka gelsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“ ‘Ahi vangin keima in na dinna, le na tona, na pusuona le na sungtumna, ka tunga na lungthahna ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei tunga na thangpai zieh le na kiphatsahna ka bilkawmah ang lutna ziehin na nah-ah nahpheh hing bulin, na kamah kamkaih kang vaw ding a, nang kuonna lam ma-ah kang leheikia ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“ ‘Nang adingin tam khu melcina ahi ding hi: Tu kumin ama thu-a a pote na ne ding a, a kum nina ciengin a li pote na ne ding hi; a kum thumna ciengin khai tu-in na at ding a, lenggui suonin a ga na ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Judah innkuon sunga a suohta a omlai teng in singkung bangin a thuhna lamah zunghlakia-in a tung lamah ga neikia ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />azieh pen Jerusalem panin a omlai teng a peikhie ding vua, Zion muol panin a hingsun honkhat a peikhie ding uhi. Topa’ deiluotna in tam thu a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in Assyria kumpipa tawh kisai-in tam bangin a gen hi: Tami khuo sungah ama lut loin thaltang khat zong kap lo ding hi. Khuopi mai-ah lum tawh pei loin khuopi simna dingin gal nanna leicien cieng lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama a peina lampi ma zui-in kilekia ding hi; tami khuopi sungah ama pei lo ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Azieh pen keima zieh le ka nasempa David ziehin tam khuopi hunkhie-in ka cing ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua zanin Topa’ vantungmi kuon a, Assyria-te giephuolah galkap tul zakhat le tul sawmnga that hi; zingmawng khuo va ciengin tua teng zosie misi luonghawm na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin inn lamah Assyria Kumpipa Sennacherib pei a, Nineveh ah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in a pasien Nisroch’ biehinn sunga a bieh laitahin, a tapate Adrammelech le Sharezer in namsau tawh ama thatin Ararat gamah a tai uhi. A tapa Esar-haddon in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Hezekiah a cina-in si dihtah hi. Amoz’ tapa Isaiah pei-in ama kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Na innkuon vai hawm in, azieh pen nang na si ding hi; na damkia nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hezekiah kawm lam nga-in Topa kungah thu ngen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“ Topa aw, na mai-ah thuman le lungsim zosie tawh ka gamtatna, le na muna-ah a hoi ka sepzona thu tu-in ei phawh in, kang thum hi,” a ci hi. Hezekiah kaa citahin kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isaiah in inntuol laita a kal masangin ama kungah Topa’ thu tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kilekia inlen ka mite makaipa Hezekiah kungah gen in. Na pu David’ Pasien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Keima in na thungetna ka za zo hi, na hlitui luongte ka mu zo hi; keima in kang damsah tahtah ding hi; a ni thum ni-in Topa’ biehinn ah na peito ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in na khan kum sawm le kum nga kang belap ding hi. Assyria kumpipa khut sung panin nangma le tami khuopi ka hunkhie ding hi; keima’ zieh le ka nasempa David ziehin tami khuopi ka hu ding hi, ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Isaiah in, “Thei tawh a kibawl moh khat hing la un. Ama a damkia nadingin amate in tuate la-in a uilut nusah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hezekiah in Isaiah kungah, “ Topa in keima ei damsah nading le a ni thum ni-a Topa’ biehinn-a ka peito nading a lim bang hi ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isaiah in, “ Topa in a ciemsa thu a bawl nadingin tami khu nang adingin Topa kung pan lim hi ding hi: Nihlim kal sawm a matawn zo hi; kal sawm nuatawn kia ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekiah in dawng a, “Nihlim kal sawm a matawn ding pen a ngaina ahi hi; tua nihlim kal sawm nuatawnsah kia zaw in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa kungah Isaiah kiko a, ama in Ahaz’ ni-nai tungah a nitumsa a hlim kal sawm a lekaikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua hunin Babylon Kumpipa, Baladan’ tapa Merodach-baladan in laihlahte le letsong khat tawh Hezekiah kungah kamtaite a sawl hi, azieh pen ama in Hezekiah a ci na hi, ci-in a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hezekiah in amate na muoh hi; ama in a goukholna inn zosie, ngun, kham, a gim namtuite, sathau mantamte, a galvante, a vankoina innte sunga om zosie amate a ensah hi; ama’ innsung hile ama’ gam sung zosie-a vante hile Hezekiah in amate a etsah lo khat beh a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Hezekiah kungah kamsang Isaiah haw-in ama kungah, “Tam mite in bang gen uh ahei? Hei pana hing pei-a nang kunga hing haw uh ahei?” a ci hi. Hezekiah in dawng a, “Amate pen Babylon gam, a gamlapi pana ang kipan ahi tabo uh hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in, “Amate in na inn sungah bang teng a mu vuoi?” a ci hi. Hezekiah in dawng a, “Ka inn sunga a om zosie a mu uhi; ka vankoina inn sungte panin amate ka etsah lo bangma a om sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Isaiah in Hezekiah kungah, “ Topa’ thugen ngai in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na inn sunga van zosie, le tuni donga na pu na pate in a na kholsa van zosie Babylon ah a kipuohmang nading hun ang tung ding hi; bangma khat beh kihen lo ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma sunga a pieng na tapa te pawlkhat kikaimang ding hi; amate in Babylon kumpi’ kumpi inn sunga nasem dingin numei uh dingin cilgesa-in a om ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hezekiah in Isaiah kungah, “Na gensa Topa’ thugen khu a hoi hi,” a ci hi. Azieh pen ama in, “Kei hun sungin kilemna le bihna a om nah leh hoi lel hi lo amah?” ci-in a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hezekiah’ nasep a omlai teng, a vanglietna, le tuikhuh le tuilahna to-in khuopi sunga tui a tunsahna, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Hezekiah lumton a, a tapa Manasseh in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh a maan ding a kipatin kum sawm le ni pha hi; ama kum sawmnga le nga sung Jerusalem ah maang hi. A nu’ min Hephzibah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite mai-ah Topa in a na delmangsa a huothuoi minamte’ gamtatnate ama in zui-in, Topa’ muna-ah a sie-in a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in a pa Hezekiah’ a na suhsietsa munsangte a lamphakia hi; Israel kumpipa Ahab’ bawlsa bangin ama in Baal adingin maitamte phutin khuom siengtho khat bawl a, vantung na zosie bie-in tuate’ na a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in, “Jerusalem-ah ka min ka koi ding hi,” a cinasa Topa’ biehinn sungah ama in maitamte a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ biehinn tuol ni gel tungah vantung nate zosie adingin maitamte a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Meihal biehna-in ama in a tapa pie a, mailam thugenkholna le khutlam etnate semin, dawilawm neite le bum tawite tawh kigop hi. Ama in Topa muna-ah sietna tampi semin ama a lungtang thahsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in David le a tapa Solomon kungah, “Ama in Israel minam zosie sung panin ka teelkhiet tam biehinn sung le Jerusalem ah ka min ka koi zing ding hi, a cina biehinn sungah ama’ bawlsa Asherah milim a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in ka thupiehsa zosie dung zui le ka nasempa Moses in amate a thupiehsa thukham zosie tawh kizui-in limtaha a zui nah po uleh, keima in a pu a pate uh tunga ka piehsa gam panin Israel’ kengte ka vahvaihsah nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a ngai nuom sih uhi. Topa in Israel mite mai-a a thasa minamte’ gamtat sangin a sie zaw-in a gamtat nadingun Manasseh in amate a lelamin a pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in a nasem a kamsangte tungtawnin thu gen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Judah Kumpipa Manasseh in tami a huothuoite a bawl ziehin, ama mai-a Amor-te’ gamtat sangin a siezaw-in gamta a, a milimte tawh Judah zong a mawsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin Israel Pasien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Jerusalem le Judah tungah tua thu a za kha tapo’ bil a vut ding sietna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mikhat in a khup a thalin kuong a nawt bangin keima in Jerusalem nawtin ka khuleh ding hi. Samaria adingin tena pikhau, le Ahab innkuon’ tena suongkhai ka hlung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in ka gouluo ding ahi a omlai teng paidawhin a galte uh khutah ka pie ding hi; tuaci’n amate pen galte’ kivana ahi ding vua, a gal zosie in a tomgam van a suoh ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile Egypt panin a pu a pate uh a peikhiet vua kipanin tuni dongin ka muna-ah a sie-in amate gamta-in kei ei lungthahsah uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua tham loin Topa muna-ah amate a siet gamtat nadingun ama in Judah mite a mawsah banah, Jerusalem mong khat panin mong khat dongah sisan a dim dongin Manasseh in maw nei lote’ sisan tampi luongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Manasseh’ nasep a omlai teng, a silbawl zosie, le ama bawlsa a mawna, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Manasseh lumton a, tuale Uzza’ um sung, ama’ inn um sungah kivui hi. A tapa Amon in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amon maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le ni pha a, kum ni sung Jerusalem ah maang hi. A nu’ min Meshullemeth hi a, Jotbah-te Haruz’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pa Manasseh’ gamtat dan bangin Topa muna-ah ama a sie-in a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in a pa totsa lampi teng zui a, a pa in a na a seppieh milimte’ na ma semin tuate a bie hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ama in a pu a pate’ Pasien ahi Topa nuasie a, Topa’ lampi zui lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amon’ nasemte in ama a sawmdap vua, ama inn sungah kumpipa a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin gam mite in Kumpi Amon a sawmdap mi zosie thatin ama munah kumpi-in a tapa Josiah a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in Amon’ bawlsa a gamtatna a omlaite Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Uzza’ um sunga ama’ hanah ama kivui hi; tua ciengin a tapa Josiah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah maan ding a kipatin kum giet pha hi; kum sawmthum le khat sung Jerusalem ah ama maang hi. Anu’ min Jedidah ahi a, Bozkath-te Adaiah’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa muna-ah a manin gamta a, a pa David’ lampi zosie zui hi; zietlamah hile veilamah hile ama piel lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpi Josiah a kum sawm le gietna kumin, kumpipa in Topa’ biehinn ah a thuvanpi pa Meshullam’ tapa Azaliah, a tapa Shaphan sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Siempu lien pa Hilkiah kungah peito inlen, kotcingte in mite kung pana a donsa uh Topa’ biehinn sunga kipeipi sum buppi a phaza ama simsah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tua sumte, Topa’ biehinn a vaan nasemte’ khut sungah piesah in. Topa’ biehinn sunga innphawte tungah tua sum amate piesah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate pen khutsiemte, innlamte, leilesuong innlam siemte ahi uhi; tuate pen biehinn puo nadinga zah ding sing lei nading le suong taw nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle thumanin a gamtat ziehun amate tung panin a khut sung vua ki-ap sum zahna sazien kingen lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siempu lien pa Hilkiah in thuvanpi pa Shaphan kungah, “ Topa’ biehinn sungah thukham laibu ka mu hi,” a ci hi. Hilkiah in Shaphan tungah tua laibu a pieh ciengin ama in a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa kungah thuvanpi pa Shaphan pei-in thu zasah a, “Na nasemte in biehinn sunga om sumte Topa’ biehinn uhte khut sungah a pie zo ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuvanpi pa Shaphan in kumpipa thu zasah a, “Siempu Hilkiah in laibu khat ei pie zo hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Shaphan in kumpipa mai-ah tua laibu a gingin a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa in thukham laibu sunga thu kigente a zah ciengin a puonte a ehmal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in siempu Hilkiah, Shaphan’ tapa Ahikam, Micaiah’ tapa Achbor, thuvanpi pa Shaphan, le kumpipa’ nasem Asaiah thu pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Pei unlen, tami laibu sunga a kimu thute tawh kisai-in kei ading, mite ading, le Judah zosie adingin Topa kungah va dong ta un, bangzieh ahei cile i pu i pate in tami laibu sunga thute, eite tawh kisai-a a kigiel zosie tawh kizui-in a sep lo ziehun, eite tungah a kikuontaw Topa’ thangpaina lien hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Harhas’ tapa Tikvah, a tapa Shallum, puon kempa’ zi kamsangnu Huldah kungah siempu Hilkiah, Ahikam, Achbor, Shaphan, le Asaiah-te a pei uhi; amate in ama’ tenna Jerusalem-a Veng Nina-ah thu a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah pholah a, “Israel Pasien, Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Keima kunga ang sawl mipa kungah gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Keima in tam mun le a sunga teng zosie tungah Judah kumpipa in laibu sunga a sim gimna zosie ka tungsah tahtah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in kei ei nuasie-in pasien dangte tungah biehna a pie vua, a khut utawh a silbawl zosie un kei ei lungthahsah ahi ziehin tam munah ka lungthahna so-in a veng nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa kunga thu dong dinga note ang sawl Judah kumpipa kungah tam bangin na gen ding uhi. Israel Pasien, Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Na zahsa thute tawh kisai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tami mun le a sunga teng mite tungah gamkhing le samsiet ahi nading uh ka thugen na zah ciengin na lungsim kisia-in Topa mai-ah nang mama neilutin, na puonte ehmalin ka mai-a na kaa ziehin keima in na thugen ka za ta hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na pu na pate utawh kang gawmton ding a, lungmuongtahin na han vuah kang kaikhawm ding hi; tami muna kang tunsah ding gimna zosie na mu kha sih ding uhi,” a ci hi. Amate in kumpipa kungah tua thu a puohkia uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Judah le Jerusalem upa zosie ama kunga kikhawm dingin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn-ah kumpipa peito a, ama tawh Judah mi zosie, Jerusalem-a teng zosie, siempute, kamsangte, le mi zosie, a neu a lien tawh a pei uhi; ama in Topa’ biehinn sunga a kimu thuciemna laibu sunga kigiel thu zosie amau’ zahin a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuompi gei-ah kumpipa ding a, tam laibu sunga kigiel thuciemna kammalte a sep nading, a lungtang le a hinna zosie tawh Topa nua a zui nading, a thupiehnate, a thupiehte, le a thukhamte a zui nadingin ama in Topa mai-ah thuciemna khat a bawl hi. Tua thuciemna sungah mi zosie a kihal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in siempu lien pa Hilkiah, a nina siempute, le kot cingte in Topa’ biehinn sung panin Baal le Asherah dinga kibawl vanzah zosie, le vantung nate zosie bieh nadinga a kibawl zosie a peipi nadingun thu a pie hi; ama in Jerusalem pulam Kidron lolai-ah tuate halin Bethel ah a vutvamte a puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Judah khuopite le Jerusalem kimvela munsangte tungah biehna pie dinga kisesa milim siempute notmang a, Baal tung, ni tung, hlapi tung, aasi honpite tung, le vantung na zosie tunga siemthoi mite zong a notmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn sung panin ama in Asherah milim la-in Jerusalem pulam Kidron Lui-ah puo-in hal a, gawtvui-in mi nautangte’ han tungah a vuite the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Asherah dinga numeite puon gatna mun Topa’ biehinn sunga pasal pahtatte’ inn a phelkhepieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Judah khuopite panin siempu zosie peipi a, Geba panin Beer-sheba dongin siempute in siemthoina-a a zah uh ahi munsangte a susie hi; ama in khuopi tunkot veilam, khuopi uhpa Joshua’ tunkot lutna muna om munsangte a phelmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jerusalem Topa’ maitam ah munsanga sem siempute a peito sih vua, hizongle a sanggamte lah vuah tol saw lo anlum a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Molech tungah a tanu hile, a tapa hile kithoina-in koima in a haltum thei lo nadingin Hinnom Kuom sunga om Topheth milim a buasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ biehinn lutna, numeite a uh cilgesa pasal Nathan-melech’ innkhan gei-a inntuolah Judah kumpite in ni tunga a ap uh sakolte a hemmang hi; tua ciengin ama in mei tawh ni sakol leengte a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua panin ama in Judah kumpite in a na bawlsa, Ahaz’ innkhan tungnung khumzanga om maitamte le Topa’ biehinn tuol nite sunga Manasseh in a na bawlsa maitamte pheldawhin satguoi a, a nengtawng teng Kidron Lui-ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon in Sidon-te’ kidahhuoina ahi Astarte pasien-nu ading, le Moab-te’ kidahhuoina ahi Chemosh pasien ading , Ammon-te’ kidahhuoina ahi Milcom pasien adinga a lam, Jerusalem nisuona lam, Sietna Muol leitaw lama munsangte a susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in biehna songte satkehin, khuom siengthote phuamang a, mihing gu in tua mun teng a tuomsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua tham loin ama in Israel a mawsah Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam in Bethel-a a na phusa munsang tunga maitam tawh a phelmang a, munsang haltumin a gawtvui hi; ama in khuom siengtho zong a haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josiah a kihei leh ama in muol tunga om hante mu hi; tuale ama in mi sawlin hante sung panin gute lasah a, Pasien’ mipa in a tangko Topa’ kammal dung zui-in ama in maitam tungah tuate halin a buasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Tua sunga ka mu phawna muolsuong bang ahiei?” a ci hi. Khuo mite in ama kungah, “Bethel-a maitam tungah na bawlsa tam thute a genkhol, Judah pana ang pei Pasien’ mipa’ han ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “Ama khawlsah khinkhian un; koima in ama’ gute khin sih un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in Samaria pana a pei kamsangpa’ gu le ama’ gute a khuci omsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tham loin Josiah in Israel kumpite’ na bawlsa, Topa a lungthahsahna uh ahi Samaria khuopite sunga munsang biehbuhnote zosie a hemmang hi; ama in Bethel-a a na bawlsa bang lienin amate tungah a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in maitam tungah tua sunga om munsanga sem siempu zosie thatin amate tungah mihing gute a hal hi. Tua ciengin Jerusalem ah ama kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa in mi zosie thu pie a, “Tam thuciemna laibu sunga a kigiel bangin Topa na Pasien uh kungah peisan pawi bawl un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel tunga thu a khen thukhente’ huna kipanin hitale Israel kumpite ahi sihle Judah kumpite’ hun sung zosie-ah hitale tam bang peisan pawi kibawl ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin Kumpi Josiah’ uh kum sawm le gietna kumin Jerusalem-a Topa kungah tami peisan pawi kibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua tham loin Topa’ biehinn sunga siempu Hilkiah in a mu laibu sunga kigiel thukham kammalte a kipsah thei nadingin Judah gam le Jerusalem-a om dawilawm neite, ai tawite, teraphim-te , inn dawite, le a kidahhuoi zosie a paimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama’ mai-a Moses’ thukham dung zui-in a lungtang zosie, a hinna zosie, le a hatna zosie tawh Topa’ lamah a kihei ama tawh a kibang kumpi om lo a, ama’ nua-ah ama tawh a kibang kumpi khat beh khang nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Manasseh in ama a lungthahsahna zosie hangin Judah tungah a sin so-in a gim nei mama a lungthahna lienpi panin Topa kihei nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka muna panin Israel ka hepdawh bangin Judah zong ka hemdawh ding hi; ka teelsa tami khuopi Jerusalem le, ‘Khum sungah ka min a om ding hi,’ ka cina biehinn ka nuol ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu-in Josiah’ gamtatna a omlaite, le a sep zosie, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama’ hun sungin Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh Neco, Euphrates gun-a Assyria kumpipa kunga haw dingin a kuonto hi. Ama tawh kimu dingin kumpi Josiah pei hi; ahi vangin Pharaoh Neco in Megiddo ah Josiah a mu ciengin a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A nasemte in Megiddo panin Jerusalem ah ama’ luong puo-in ama’ hanah a vui uhi. Khum gam mite in Josiah’ tapa Jehoahaz la-in sathau a nu vua, a pa munah kumpi-in ama a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehoahaz maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le thum pha hi; hla thum sung ama Jerusalem ah maang hi. A nu’ min Hamutal ahi a, Libnah-te Jeremiah’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A pu a pate gamtatnasa bang lienin Topa’ muna-ah ama a siet gamtat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in Jerusalem a uh thei lo nadingin Pharaoh Neco in Hamath gam sung Riblah khuo-ah ama khum a, gam sungah ngun talent zakhat le kham talent khat siehin kai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pharaoh Neco in a pa Josiah munah Josiah’ tapa Eliakim kumpi-in koi a, tuale ama’ min Jehoiakim-in a khel hi. Ahi vangin ama in Jehoahaz a peipi hi; Egypt ah ama tungin khum sungah a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jehoiakim in Pharaoh tungah ngun le kham a pie a, ahi vangin Pharaoh’ ngetza sum a pieh zawh nadingin a gam sungah phiengsieh a dong hi. Pharaoh Neco tunga a pieh dingin amau’ neina tawh kizui-in ama in gam sung mite kung panin ngun le kham a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehoiakim maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le nga pha hi; Jerusalem ah kum sawm le khat sung maang hi. A nu’ min Zebidah ahi a, Rumah-te Pedaiah’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A pu a pate’ gamtat bang lienin Topa’ muna-ah ama a siet gamtat hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama’ hun sungin Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar kuonto hi; Jehoiakim kum thum sung ama’ sila a suoh hi; tua ciengin Jehoiakim kiphinin ama a ledo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in ama a langpang dingin Chaldea mihonte, Aram mihonte, Moab mihonte, le Ammon mihonte a sawl hi. Ama’ nasem kamsangte tungtawnin ama’ gen Topa’ kammal dung zui-in ama in Judah a langpang ding le a susie dingin amate a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tahtahin Manasseh’ mawnate, a bawlsa mawnate zosie ziehin ama’ muna panin amate a khin thei nadingin Topa’ thupiehna tawh Judah tunga tam thute a tung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuale mawna nei lo mite’ sisan a luonsahnate zosie zieh zong ahi hi. Ama in mawna nei lo mite’ sisan tawh Jerusalem a kidimsah ziehin Topa in ama’ mawna maisah nuom lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in Jehoiakim’ sepna a omlai teng, le a bawl zosie, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pu a pate tawh ama a lumton hi; tua ciengin a tapa Jehoiachin in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in Egypt kumpipa-a’ ahi Egypt Lui panin Euphrates Gun dongin a unpi-in lahpieh zo ta ahi ziehin ama’ gam panin Egypt kumpipa a kuonkia nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiachin maan ding a kipatin kum sawm le giet pha hi; ama hla thum sung Jerusalem ah maang hi. A nu’ min Nehushta ahi a, Jerusalem-te Elnathan’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pu a pate gamtat bang lienin Topa muna-ah ama siet gamtat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin Jerusalem-ah Babylon kumpi Nebuchadnezzar’ nasemte kuonto-in tua khuopi a kui-im uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A nasemte in a kui-im laitahin tua khuopi-ah Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehoiachin in Babylon kumpipa tungah ama-a kipan a nu, a uliente, le kumpi inn sunga uliente a kipie uhi. Ama in a uh a kum gietna kumin Babylon kumpipa in ama salin a man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ inn sunga gou zosie le kumpipa’ inn sunga goute puomang hi; tamte zosie Topa in a na genkholsa ahi ma bangin ama in Babylon kumpipa Solomon in a na bawlsa Topa’ biehinn sunga a om kham vanzah zosie a tawguoi sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in Jerusalem mi zosie, ulien zosie, galhang zosie, sala kiman mi tul sawm, khutsiem zosie le siakheng zosie, a gama mi zawng pente ci sim lo, koima hen nei loin a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in Babylon ah Jehoiachin peipi hi; ama in Jerusalem panin Babylon ah kumpipa’ nu, kumpipa’ zite, a uliente, le gam upate galmatin peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in galsim thei ding galhang mite zosie, le mi thahat zosie a unpi-in tul sagi, le khutsiemte le siakhengte tulkhat, galmatin Babylon ah a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in ama tanga kumpi-in Jehoachin’ gangpa Mattaniah koi a, ama’ min Zedekiah-in a khelpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zedekiah maan ding a kipatin kum sawmni le khat pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum sawm le khat sung maang hi. A nu’ min Hamutal ahi a, Libnah-te Jeremiah’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jehoiakim’ gamtat bang lienin Topa’ muna-ah ama a siet gamtat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tahtahin, Jerusalem le Judah in Topa a lungthahsah ziehun ama kung panin amate a notmang hi. Zedekiah in Babylon kumpipa a ledo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama in a uh zaw a kum kuona, a hla sawmna, a ni sawm ni-in Jerusalem sim dingin Babylon kumpi Nebuchadnezzar a galkap zosie tawh kuonin a kui-im hi; amate in a kimvelah tua khuo kui-im nading panmun a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpi Zedekiah a kum sawm le khatna kum dongin tua khuopi kikui-im hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hla lina, a ni kuo ni-in tua khuopi sungah kielpi nasie ahi ziehin tua gam mite neh ding an om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin khuopi ki-imna kulbang mun khat a phetvang vua, khuopi kimvelah Chaldea-te a om vangun, kumpipa’ um gei-a kulbang gel kikalah zan lai-in a galkapte tawh kumpipa tai a, Arabah lam manaw-in a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin Chaldea galkapte in kumpipa delin Jericho zanglei-ah a pha uhi; a galkap zosie kithethangin ama a nuasie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa manin ama tunga thukhen, Riblah-a Babylon kumpipa kungah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zedekiah’ muna-ah a tapa thatin tua ciengin Zedekiah’ mit a kheipieh uhi; amate in ama kol bulin Babylon ah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hla ngana, a ni sagi ni-in, Babylon kumpi Nebuchadnezzar a kum sawm le kuo cin kumin, Jerusalem ah Babylon kumpipa’ nasem, a cingte a uh galkap bupa Nebuzaradan a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ biehinn, kumpipa’ inn, le Jerusalem khuo sunga inn zosie hal hi; ama in inn thupi zosie haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A cingte a uh galkap bupa tawh a omton Chaldea galkap zosie in Jerusalem kimvela om kulbangte a satguoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A cingte a uh galkap bupa Nebuzaradan in khuopi sunga kinuasie a omlai teng le Babylon kumpipa lama a taite, mi honpi a omlai teng tawh salin a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin a cingte a uh galkap bupa in lengga um bawl ding le lo kai dingin tua gammi a zawngpen pawlkhat a nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chaldea-te in Topa’ biehinn sunga a om sumngo khuompite, Topa’ biehinn sunga a om tuikuong tunnate, le sumngo tuikuongpi tawguoi siengin Babylon-ah a sumngo a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in beelte, kawbiate, taite te, gimnamtui halna kuongte, le biehbuh nasepna-a kizang sumngo vanzah zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />vutluonate le haite zong a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn adingin Solomon in a bawl khuompi nite, tuikuongpi khat, a tunnate, sumngo tawh a kibawl tam bang vanzah zosie ahile a gihna te zawh ding hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuompi khat a sanna tong sawm le giet hi a, tua tungah sumngo khuomlu zepna khat a om hi; tua khuomlu zepna pen a sanna tong thum ahi hi; khuomlu zepna kimvelah a unpi-a sumngo tawh kibawl lenta banga kiphante le mang kawlsingte a om hi. Khuompi nina zong tua ma bangin lenta banga kiphan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A cing galkap bupa in siempu lien pa Seraiah, siempu a nina Zephaniah, le kotcing mi thum man hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />khuopi panin galkapte a uh galkap bupa khat, le khuopi sunga om kumpipa’ thudawhpite mi nga man hi. Gamsung mite a khawm galkap mangpa’ thuvanpi pa zong man hi. Khuopi sunga a om gamsung mi sawmguh zong man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A cing galkap bupa Nebuzaradan in amate manin Riblah-a Babylon kumpipa kungah peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in amate sat a, Hamath gam sunga Riblah-ah that hi. Tuaci’n ama’ gam panin Judah salin kikai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judah gam sunga a omlai teng tunga uhpi dingin ama in Shaphan’ tapa Ahikam, a tapa Gedaliah se hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu-in galkap bute zosie le a mite, Babylon kumpipa in uhpa dingin Gedaliah a sena thu a zah uh ciengin, amate zong a mite utawh Mizpah-a Gedaliah kungah a pei uhi. A minte uh pen Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael, Kareah’ tapa Johanan, Netophah-te Tanhumeth’ tapa Seraiah, le Maacath-te Jaazaniah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate le a mite kungah Gedaliah kiciem a, “Chaldea uliente ziehin zau sih un. Gam sungah tengin, Babylon kumpipa’ na sem un. Tua hile no adingin thu a hoi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin a hla sagina a cin ciengin kumpipa innkuon sung panin Elishama’ tapa Nethaniah, a tapa Ishmael mihing sawm tawh kuon a, Gedaliah le Judea-te le Mizpah-a ama tawh a omton Chaldea-te simin that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin a sang a ngiemin mi zosie le galkap bute kithawi-in Egypt ah a tai uhi; azieh pen amate in Chaldea-te a giing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judah kumpi Jehoiachin a thongkieh zaw kum sawmthum le sagi a cin kum, hla sawm le hla nina, tua hla ni sawmni le ni sagi a cin ni, Babylon kumpipa Evil-merodach a maan kumin ama in a hepi ziehin thong panin Jehoiakhin hla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in kamdam tawh ama hopi a, Babylon gama a ompi kumpi dangte’ topha sangin a sangzaw munah ama a tosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jehoiachin in a thong puonte a sutdawh hi. Ama’ hin sungin ama in kumpipa’ mai-ah nisielin an ne-in tui a dawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A hin sungin kumpipa in a zahtawm ding sih den a, nisielin ama tanh a pie den hi.
  </para>
</usx>
